	(62, 63, 'EGVGBPES001', 'Peter England E-Gift Voucher', 'One can buy a richly-embroidered traditional sherwani here for a traditional event, or pick up classy jeans, denim jackets or casual sports clothing. Just purchase a Peter England e-Gift card, and it will be instantly delivered on email. It’s that easy with an e-Gift card – buy, checkout and instantly make someone happy. ', '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"100","max":"25000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 0, NULL, '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"100","max":"25000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 'DIGITAL', '0', '{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"}', '356', '{"thumbnail":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGVGBPES001\\/d\\/thumbnail\\/63_microsite.jpg","mobile":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGVGBPES001\\/d\\/mobile\\/63_microsite.jpg","base":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGVGBPES001\\/d\\/image\\/63_microsite.jpg","small":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGVGBPES001\\/d\\/small_image\\/63_microsite.png"}', '{"link":"https:\\/\\/woohoo.app.link\\/e\\/bCVXcSvw5tb","content":"This EGC shall have a validity period of 6 months from the date of issuance<br\\/>This E- Gift Card is redeemable on all merchandise at Peter England stores across India.<br\\/>This E- Gift Card can be redeemed just once.<br\\/>This Gift card\\/ E- Gift Card can be redeemed only at selected outlets.<br\\/>This E- Gift Card holds no value until activated with a minimum purchase. There is no extra fee to obtain this card.<br\\/>Please present the print out of this E- Gift Card to the customer relationship officer prior to billing or when you want to redeem the card.<br\\/>This card is not redeemable for cash or credit.<br\\/>In case of a damaged card, a new card will