	(86, 456, 'EGCGBBS001', 'BlueStone E-Gift Cards', 'Gift your loved one jewelry of their choice with a Bluestone gift card. With a wide variety of jewelry for the entire family – Women, Men & Children, there is something for everyone at Bluestone. Your loved ones can choose certified jewelry in gold, platinum, diamonds from over 4000 designs, with popular and trendy motifs like hearts, floral, peacocks and religious.  \r\n\r\n', '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"500","max":"50000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 0, NULL, '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"500","max":"50000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 'DIGITAL', '0', '{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"}', '356', '{"thumbnail":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBBS001\\/d\\/thumbnail\\/456_microsite.jpg","mobile":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBBS001\\/d\\/mobile\\/456_microsite.jpg","base":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBBS001\\/d\\/image\\/456_microsite.jpg","small":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBBS001\\/d\\/small_image\\/456_microsite.png"}', '{"link":"https:\\/\\/woohoo.app.link\\/e\\/X0czkByn5tb","content":"Gift Card(s) can be redeemed on www.bluestone.com and offline stores (www.bluestone.com\\/store.html)<br\\/>Gift card can be redeemed on plain gold jewellery, Gold Coins, Silver Coins, Solitaire, preset Solitaires, Diamond Jewellery and Gemstone Jewellery.<br\\/>On the payment page, Click on the tab \\"Gift Card\\" and enter your 16 digit Gift Card number and pin for redemption.<br\\/>Multiple Gift Card(s) can be used in a single transaction. Gift Card(s) can be combined with any other payment type on www.bluestone.com.<br\\/>Gift cards can also be redeemed partially, as many times as a user wishes to, till its balance is consumed or it expires.<br\\/>Gift cards are valid for a period of 6 months from the date of issuance to the recipient.<br\\/>Gift cards cannot be used to purchase another Gift Card.<br\\/>Payment mode will be Net Banking, Credit\\/Debit Card, Blue Cash.<br\\/>Gift Card(s) once bought online, shall be considered as sold and cannot be Cancelled, Exchanged or Refunded.<br\\/>If lost or misused, the Gift Card(s) cannot be replaced. Gift cards are void if resold and cannot be exchanged for credit(s) or cash and cannot be re-validated once past expiry date.<br\\/>In addition to these Terms and Conditions, BlueStone Gift Card(s) and their use on our website are also subject to BlueStone\'s general Terms of Use & BlueStone\'s decision will be final in case of any dispute.<br\\/>BlueStone may change (add to, delete, or amend) these terms from time to time. Unless stated otherwise, the changes will apply to any new BlueStone gift card. Any gift cards that you purchase are for personal, non-commercial use and enjoyment only. The same may be shared with family and friends, but may not be advertised, sold or used as promotional items by the purchaser or anyone else without BlueStone\'s prior written consent.<br\\/>All disputes, with respect to the products and services offered in this connection, are subject to Bangalore jurisdiction.<br\\/>E-Gift Cards are normally delivered instantly. But sometimes due to system issues, the delivery can be delayed up-to 24 - 48 hours."}', '["2","7","8","10","50","55","57","92","132","147","171","192","238","264","266","274","276","282","284","288","317","338","355","359","365","383","456","498","508","521","530","531","550","591","592","594","595","597","599","607","608","610","620","622","642","689","690","692","702","704","725","792","796"]', NULL, 'false', '[]', 'false', '1 year from the date of issue.', NULL, '[]', '[]', NULL, 'Bluestone', '', 'a:9:{s:7:"barcode";a:1:{s:8:"encoding";N;}s:15:"redemptionTerms";a:0:{}s:4:"type";s:3:"clp";s:4:"code";s:18:"QC-EGC-BSElite-VAR";s:13:"erupi_purpose";N;s:16:"erupi_payer_type";N;s:16:"erupi_payee_type";N;s:24:"erupi_recurrence_pattern";N;s:14:"erupi_validity";N;}', 'a:7:{s:7:"enabled";b:1;s:15:"payment_methods";a:1:{i:0;s:3:"svc";}s:13:"account_types";a:2:{i:0;s:12:"BANK_ACCOUNT";i:1;s:3:"UPI";}s:17:"transaction_types";a:3:{i:0;s:4:"IMPS";i:1;s:4:"NEFT";i:2;s:3:"UPI";}s:21:"maximum_beneficiaries";s:0:"";s:28:"validate_terms_and_condition";s:0:"";s:10:"validation";a:3:{s:6:"amount";s:1:"1";s:16:"edit_beneficiary";b:1;s:18:"convenience_charge";s:0:"";}}', '[{"code":false}]', 'bluestone-e-gift-cards', '500', '50000', NULL, '2023-12-11 13:37:01', '2016-04-16T19:25:08+00:00', '2023-11-28T19:13:35+00:00', 330),
	(87, 493, 'EGVGBKFC001', 'KFC E-Gift Voucher', 'Finger licking chicken at your fingertips from KFC. This American fast food restaurant has over 350 outlets pan India. KFC offers crispy chicken with various blends of herbs and spices and a detailed sides menu so that you can pick from their various food options and drinks. With exciting deals running on their menu, KFC makes enjoying their Chicken even more enjoyable no matter what the occasion is. From Burgers to rice bowls, snacks and beverages, this fast food outlet has taken care of its side’s menu with great interest as well. \r\nSuch menu card makes KFC E-Gift Card the best gift one could ask for. Rather than gifting a generic gift, give them the chance to choose their favorite dish with the help of gift cards. Bring a smile on your loved one’s faces with thoughtful gifting option for every occasion.', '{"price":"SLAB","type":"SLAB","min":"100","max":"1000","denominations":["100","250","500","1000"],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 0, NULL, '{"price":"SLAB","type":"SLAB","min":"100","max":"1000","denominations":["100","250","500","1000"],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 'DIGITAL', '0', '{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"}', '356', '{"thumbnail":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGVGBKFC001\\/d\\/thumbnail\\/493_microsite.jpg","mobile":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGVGBKFC001\\/d\\/mobile\\/493_microsite.jpg","base":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGVGBKFC001\\/d\\/image\\/493_microsite.jpg","small":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGVGBKFC001\\/d\\/small_image\\/493_microsite.png"}', '{"link":"https:\\/\\/woohoo.app.link\\/e\\/FLqArFoJKjb","content":"This KFC E-Gift Card (E-GC) is issued by Yum! Restaurants (India) Private Limited & its authorized franchisees for making Payments at participating KFC Stores in India.<br\\/>The person who has the Yum! Restaurants E-Gift Card is deemed to be the beneficiary.<br\\/>Do inform the cashier that you plan to use E-Gift Card for making payments before billing.<br\\/>Purchases can be done on Website \\/ App for the amount or less than that in the card, Example, if a card has a balance of Rs 500, customer can buy for Rs 500 or less on Website \\/ App.<br\\/>This E-Gift Card is a one-time use card & any unused balance cannot be used again or be exchanged for Cash.<br\\/>More than one E-Gift Card can be used in one bill in stores.<br\\/>No cash refunds will be given against the card (including in case of loss or otherwise).<br\\/>Any balance in this card is valid for 6 months from the date of issue and any unused balance will expire automatically. E-Gift Card Cannot be revalidated once expired.<br\\/>Rights to amend Terms & Conditions reserved with \\u201cYum\\u201d and its authorized franchisees without prior notice.<br\\/>Only participating KFC Stores would accept the E-Gift Card, YUM Restaurants and its authorized franchisees would add or remove an outlet without giving any prior notice.<br\\/>For all amendments, card balance & expiry details, please visit https:\\/\\/online.kfc.co.in<br\\/>The user unconditionally accepts all T&C and shall not raise any disputes in this regard. Any dispute related to the E-Gift Card should be referred to the issuing company and the decision of the issuing company shall be final.<br\\/>All disputes subject to exclusive jurisdiction of court at New Delhi.<br\\/>For Balance and expiry check: SMS 16-digit card no, in this format, e.g., 1234123412341234 to 55757575."}', '["7","8","10","19","50","192","216","220","249","274","276","288","289","301","317","338","607","608","632","682","689","690","714","721","725","759","760","770","774","792","794","797","815"]', NULL, 'false', '[]', 'false', '6 months from the date of issue.', NULL, '[]', '[]', NULL, 'KFC', '', 'a:9:{s:7:"barcode"