V amount, the balance would be lost & if the value of the service exceeds the value of e-gift card, difference shall be paid by the bearer.<br\\/>Protect the e-gift card number and PIN to avoid misuse and treat it like cash. Nature\\u2019s Basket shall not assume any liability in case the card PIN\\/E-Voucher gets stolen\\/compromised. It will not be replaced or refunded.<br\\/>This E-voucher cannot be exchanged for cash. No returns\\/ refunds will be given against the E-voucher.<br\\/>NBL reserves the right to change the \\u2018Terms and Conditions\\u2019 at any time without prior information.<br\\/>Any dispute should be referred to Natures Basket Limited (company), and the decision of the company shall be final.<br\\/>All disputes are subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of competent courts of Mumbai, India.<br\\/>For any queries write to cs@naturesbasket.co.in or call +91 92200 98000 or contact your nearest Nature\\u2019s Basket store."}', '["2","7","8","10","17","50","132","192","216","227","264","276","288","319","323","338","363","498","607","608","610","614","618","623","629","642","689","690","692","696","700","705","711","721","725","792","796"]', NULL, 'false', '[]', 'false', '1 year from the date of issue.', NULL, '[]', '[]', NULL, 'Nature\'s Basket', '', 'a:9:{s:7:"barcode";a:1:{s:8:"encoding";N;}s:15:"redemptionTerms";a:0:{}s:4:"type";s:3:"clp";s:4:"code";s:14:"QC-EGC-GNB-VAR";s:13:"erupi_purpose";N;s:16:"erupi_payer_type";N;s:16:"erupi_payee_type";N;s:24:"erupi_recurrence_pattern";N;s:14:"erupi_validity";N;}', 'a:7:{s:7:"enabled";b:1;s:15:"payment_methods";a:1:{i:0;s:3:"svc";}s:13:"account_types";a:2:{i:0;s:12:"BANK_ACCOUNT";i:1;s:3:"UPI";}s:17:"transaction_types";a:3:{i:0;s:4:"IMPS";i:1;s:4:"NEFT";i:2;s:3:"UPI";}s:21:"maximum_beneficiaries";s:0:"";s:28:"validate_terms_and_condition";s:0:"";s:10:"validation";a:3:{s:6:"amount";s:1:"1";s:16:"edit_beneficiary";b:1;s:18:"convenience_charge";s:0:"";}}', '[{"code":false}]', 'godrej-nature-s-basket-e-gift-ca