	(94, 1021, 'EGCGBBCR001', 'BodyCraft E-Gift Card', 'Bodycraft Spa & Salon has been a culmination of expertise & excellence, enjoying the patronage of very satisfied & discerning clientele. Trained & experienced professionals strive to provide our clients with the best solutions in the field of hair care, skin care, personal grooming and wellness. Under one roof you can try the latest hairstyle, avail specialised clinical treatments, pamper yourself to a fancy nail art or indulge in the sheer luxury of our spa.', '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"500","max":"10000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 0, NULL, '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"500","max":"10000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 'DIGITAL', '0', '{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"}', '356', '{"thumbnail":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBBCR001\\/d\\/thumbnail\\/1021_microsite.jpg","mobile":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBBCR001\\/d\\/mobile\\/1021_microsite.jpg","base":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBBCR001\\/d\\/image\\/1021_microsite.jpg","small":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBBCR001\\/d\\/small_image\\/1021_microsite.png"}', '{"link":"https:\\/\\/woohoo.app.link\\/e\\/tjPIzLwfZib","content":"The E-gift card is valid at all company-owned Bodycraft Spa & Salon outlets. <br\\/>It is mandatory to submit the E-Gift card details, that is, Gift card number & pin, to the Bodycraft team before the service starts.<br\\/>The E-gift card is valid on all days of the week.<br\\/>Multiple E-gift cards can be clubbed for redemption.<br\\/>The E-gift card can be used multiple times till the balance is left on the card. The remaining balance, if any, will not be refunded through any medium.<br\\/>The E-gift card cannot be used to purchase Products, Memberships, Packages at Bodycraft.<br\\/>The E-gift card cannot be clubbed with any other discounts, offers, promos, packages & membership benefits running at Bodycraft<br\\/>E-Gift card once purchased, cannot be refunded.<br\\/>E-Gift card validity cannot be extended.<br\\/>The validity of the E-gift Card is for 6 months."}', '["7","8","50","132","147","192","276","288","359","367","385","449","498","508","527","530","591","596","597","599","607","608","613","642","668","689","690","695","725","797","808","809","815"]', NULL, 'false', '[]', 'false', '6 Months from the date of activation', NULL, '[]', '[]', NULL, 'BodyCraft', '', 'a:9:{s:7:"barcode";a:1:{s:8:"encoding";N;}s:15:"redemptionTerms";a:0:{}s:4:"type";s:3:"clp";s:4:"code";s:20:"BodyCraft eGift Card";s:13:"erupi_purpose";N;s:16:"erupi_payer_type";N;s:16:"erupi_payee_type";N;s:24:"erupi_recurrence_pattern";N;s:14:"erupi_validity";N;}', 'a:7:{s:7:"enabled";b:1;s:15:"payment_methods";a:1:{i:0;s:3:"svc";}s:13:"account_types";a:2:{i:0;s:12:"BANK_ACCOUNT";i:1;s:3:"UPI";}s:17:"transaction_types";a:3:{i:0;s:4:"IMPS";i:1;s:4:"NEFT";i:2;s:3:"UPI";}s:21:"maximum_beneficiaries";s:0:"";s:28:"validate_terms_and_condition";s:0:"";s:10:"validation";a:3:{s:6:"amount";s:1:"1";s:16:"edit_beneficiary";b:1;s:18:"convenience_charge";s:0:"";}}', '[{"code":false}]', 'bodycraft-egift-card', '500', '10000', NULL, '2023-12-11 13:37:04', '2017-11-29T12:49:53+00:00', '2023-11-02T18:28:19+00:00', 330),
	(95, 1082, 'EGCGBTNRS001', 'Taneira E-Gift card', 'Taneira is the latest brand addition from Titan group, which aims to revive one of the oldest occupations in our country – handloom weaving and the oldest garment, the saree. They aim to provide authentic, natural materials, handwoven sarees and celebrate Indian craftsmanship, heritage and exclusive designs', '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"250","max":"49999","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 0, NULL, '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"250","max":"49999","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 'DIGITAL', '0', '{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"}', '356', '{"thumbnail":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBTNRS001\\/d\\/thumbnail\\/1082_microsite.jpg","mobile":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBTNRS001\\/d\\/mobile\\/1082_microsite.jpg","base":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBTNRS001\\/d\\/image\\/1082_microsite.jpg","small":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBTNRS001\\/d\\/small_image\\/1082_microsite.png"}', '{"link":"https:\\/\\/woohoo.app.link\\/e\\/FQQofcmx5tb","content":"This EGC shall have a validity period of 6 months from the date of issuance<br\\/>This card is the property of Titan Company Limited, to whom it should be returned upon request. <br\\/>This is not a credit card. This card holds no value unless activated at Taneira stores\\/Taneira website. <br\\/>This card is redeemable on purchase of products at any Taneira store. <br\\/>This card can neither be redeemed for cash, nor can any unutilised balance be refunded; however, the balance can be carried forward for subsequent purchases made within validity period. <br\\/>This card is reloadable for any amount and the amount loaded on the card shall be valid for 180 days from the date of loading\\/reloading. <br\\/>This card has to be presented at the billing desk to use for billing of products or for reloading. <br\\/>If this card is damaged, lost or stolen, it will not be issued again nor will any cash be refunded. <br\\/>Charge slip issued at the time of loading, reloading or redemption of the card will show the remaining card balance and validity"}', '["7","8","10","14","50","132","147","192","276","288","359","364","398","497","508","526","530","597","599","607","608","610","611","642","689","690","692","693","725","732","792","797"]', NULL, 'false', '[]', 'false', '6 Months from the Date of Activation', NULL, '[]', '[]', NULL, 'Taneira', '', 'a:9:{s:7:"barcode";a:1:{s:8:"encoding";N;}s:15:"redemptionTerms";a:0:{}s:4:"type";s:3:"clp";s:4:"code";s:18:"Taneira eGift Card";s:13:"erupi_purpose";N;s:16:"erupi_payer_type";N;s:16:"erupi_payee_type";N;s:24:"erupi_recurrence_pattern";N;s:14:"erupi_validity";N;}', 'a:7:{s:7:"enabled";b:1;s:15:"payment_methods";a:1:{i:0;s:3:"svc";}s:13:"account_types";a:2:{i:0;s:12:"BANK_ACCOUNT";i:1;s:3:"UPI";}s:17:"transaction_types";a:3:{i:0;s:4:"IMPS";i:1;s:4:"NEFT";i:2;s:3:"UPI";}s:21:"maximum_beneficiaries";s:0:"";s:28:"validate_terms_and_condition";s:0:"";s:10:"validation";a:3:{s:6:"amount";s:1:"1";s:16:"edit_beneficiary";b:1;s:18:"convenience_charge";s:0:"";}}', '[{"code":false}]', 'taneira-e-gift-card', '250', '49999', NULL, '2023-12-11 13:37:04', '2018-02-14T09:57:54+00:00', '2023-11-02T18:28:09+00:00', 330),
	(96, 1142, 'EGCGBPCJ004', 'PCJ Diamond Jewellery E-Gift Card', 'It all started when PC Jeweller first opened its first showroom in 2005 in Karol Bagh, New Delhi with a vision to redefine elegance, allure and style in the form of stunning pieces of jewellery. Today we have physical presence at 93 showrooms across 73 cities and 20 states.\r\nSince its inception, the company has been a pioneer in designs as every product is crafted to a standard of perfection. Whether it is elaborate wedding jewellery or affordable wearables, PC Jeweller has fashioned exceptional designs with unmatched quality. Over time, timeless treasures from PC Jeweller have helped intimate moments become lifetime memories.\r\nCompany’s business model consists of setting up large format, stand alone showrooms at high street locations. Its stores stock a wide range of jewellery across all price points, with an increasing focus on diamond jewellery. The company sells only hallmarked jewellery and certified diamond jewellery. This assurance on quality and purity along with transparent and customer friendly policies have enabled PCJ to become an established and trusted brand name in a short time span.\r\nFrom sourcing of raw materials to the sale of the finished product, all our processes are integrated and aligned. We map out customer preferences and manufacture products in a way that leaves our customers spoilt for choice while making their purchases. Throughout the entire process, stringent quality measures are taken to ensure the purity, value and finish of the product. Our expertise extends to the possibilities of customized and personalized designs to help the customer find and design her or his perfect piece of jewellery.\r\nPC Jeweller has made a remarkable journey so far and has created a brand of its own with sustainable customer initiatives and unrivalled quality that loyal customers vouch for. With contemporary and classic designs aimed for longevity, we are committed to providing you the best buying experience using a collaborative approach across both online platform and showrooms.\r\nWe hope to continue being inspired and create the most desired jewels.', '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"1000","max":"100000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 0, NULL, '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"1000","max":"100000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 'DIGITAL', '0', '{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"}', '356', '{"thumbnail":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBPCJ004\\/d\\/thumbnail\\/1142_microsite.jpg","mobile":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBPCJ004\\/d\\/mobile\\/1142_microsite.jpg","base":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBPCJ004\\/d\\/image\\/1142_microsite.jpg","small":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBPCJ004\\/d\\/small_image\\/1142_microsite.jpg"}', '{"link":"https:\\/\\/woohoo.app.link\\/e\\/aqc8Bq3uiAb","content":"This EGC shall have a validity period of 1 year from the date of issuance<br\\/>PC Jeweller Gift Card\\/ e-Gift Card is not valid until activated.<br\\/>The Gift Card\\/ e-Gift Card can be purchased for variable denomination upto Rs. 1,00,000.<br\\/>Valid Gift Card\\/ e-Gift Card in its original form has to be presented as a payment option at the time of making a purchase.<br\\/>Multiple transactions can be performed on a Gift Card \\/ e-Gift Card until the value of the card is exhausted.<br\\/>A Gold Coin Card can be used to purchase Gold Coin\\/ Diamond Jewellery\\/ Gold Jewellery.<br\\/>A Gold Jewellery Card can be used to purchase Diamond Jewellery\\/ Gold Jewellery.<br\\/>A Diamond Jewellery Card can be used to purchase Diamond Jewellery only<br\\/>The E- Gift Card\\u2019s will carry a card number and a PIN, which will be used for redemption \\/ validation of the card and the amount. The PC Jeweller E- Gift Card is a bearer\'s card hence no OTP will be sent to the customer at the time of redemption. <br\\/>The Gift Card\\/ e-Gift Card may be used at all PC Jeweller stores.<br\\/>The Gift Card \\/ e-Gift Card balance must be used within one year of the date of issue.<br\\/>Any unused balance will expire after one year from the date of issue.<br\\/>This Gift Card\\/ e-Gift Card cannot be transferred for balance value or redeemed for cash.<br\\/>This Gift Card\\/ e-Gift Card is cash equivalent. Qwikcilver, PC Jeweller or their affiliates are not responsible if this Gift Card is lost, stolen or destroyed or used without permission.<br\\/>No refund, replacement or cash back would be considered against the Gift Card\\/ E-Gift Card.<br\\/>Any defaced, spoiled or cancelled physical Gift Card is termed invalid and shall not be accepted.<br\\/>Any dispute shall be referred to PC Jeweller and the decision of PC Jeweller will be final.<br\\/>Subject to the foregoing, these terms and conditions shall be subject to the jurisdiction of courts at New Delhi, India.<br\\/>PC Jeweller  reserves the entitlement to amend these terms and conditions from time to time. Any change in these terms and conditions can be viewed on our website.<br\\/>Non-receipt of Gift Card post 7 days of receipt of dispatch confirmation has to be reported immediately or else Qwikcilver, PC Jeweller or their affiliates will not be liable for the misuse of the card.<br\\/>Purchase against the Gift Card will be subject to government prescribed limits for cash purchases. <br\\/>This Gift card is acceptable only on Diamond Jewellery"}', '["7","8","10","50","55","132","147","192","276","288","364","424","498","607","608","610","620","642","668","689","690","692","702","725","792","796","815"]', NULL, 'false', '[]', 'false', '1 year from the date of activation', NULL, '[]', '[]', NULL, 'PC Jeweller', '', 'a:9:{s:7:"barcode";a:1:{s:8:"encoding";N;}s:15:"redemptionTerm