	(114, 1489, 'EGCGBJS002', 'Jos Alukkas Coin E-Gift Card', 'Jos Alukkas is a name to reckon in the jewellery industry. Designing jewellery in gold, diamond and platinum for over five decades, Jos Alukkas is the first ISO 9001:2000 certified jewellery group in the world showcasing BIS certified 916 hallmarked gold. The jewellery brand has become a trusted name in quality, innovative, trendy jewellery, with 40-plus showrooms and an online store too.\r\nA pioneer in introducing the gold supermarket concept in India, Jos Alukkas has steadily grown into a favourite jewellery name across the country and abroad. Every Jos Alukkas showroom is a one-stop shop for your jewellery dreams. Pure jewellery, inspiring designs, comfortable ambience, courteous staff and great deals guarantee you a never-before jewellery shopping experience. ', '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"500","max":"50000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 0, NULL, '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"500","max":"50000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 'DIGITAL', '0', '{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"}', '356', '{"thumbnail":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBJS002\\/d\\/thumbnail\\/1489_microsite.jpg","mobile":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBJS002\\/d\\/mobile\\/1489_microsite.jpg","base":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBJS002\\/d\\/image\\/1489_microsite.jpg","small":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBJS002\\/d\\/small_image\\/1489_microsite.jpg"}', '{"link":"https:\\/\\/bnc.lt\\/m\\/50mPrdg94W","content":"The validity of the e-Gift Card is 1 year from the date of issue. <br\\/>This e-Gift Card is redeemable at all Jos Alukkas stores in India. Multiple gift cards can be used for a single transaction.<br\\/>This e-Gift Cards can