	(116, 1509, 'EGCGBFM001', 'FreshMenu E-Gift Card', 'Freshmenu is the go-to neighbourhood food delivery option you can turn to when you\'re famished. Our chefs create a variety of plated meals on demand, to make sure that you are spoilt for choice. \r\nAt FreshMenu, all meals are crafted with the finest ingredients including farm fresh vegetables and meat', '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"1","max":"10000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 0, NULL, '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"1","max":"10000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 'DIGITAL', '0', '{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"}', '356', '{"thumbnail":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBFM001\\/d\\/thumbnail\\/1509_microsite.jpg","mobile":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBFM001\\/d\\/mobile\\/1509_microsite.jpg","base":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBFM001\\/d\\/image\\/1509_microsite.jpg","small":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBFM001\\/d\\/small_image\\/1509_microsite.png"}', '{"link":"https:\\/\\/woohoo.app.link\\/e\\/FeKPP0mhpgb","content":"Valid only in Bangalore, Delhi, Gurgaon, and Mumbai.<br\\/>eGift Card can be used on Freshmenu website, App and M-site.<br\\/>eGift Card will be valid for a period of up to 12 months from the date of issue.<br\\/>Entire eGift Card amount will be redeemed and credited to the Freshmenu wallet. After the amount is credited, it can be used across multiple orders.<br\\/>eGift Card is not redeemable for cash or credit.<br\\/>If the customer misplaces the eGift card, Freshmenu shall not be responsible to reimburse\\/refund.<br\\/>No duplicate will be issued if the eGift card is lost or misplaced.<br\\/>eGift Card cannot be re-validated once expired.<br\\/>The holder of the eGift card is deemed to be the beneficiary.<br\\/>The validity period of the eGift card will not be extended under any circumstances.<br\\/>Any dispute should be referred to Freshmenu and the decision of Freshmenu shall be final.<br\\/>If eGift Card is purchased in a city not mentioned above, the amount will not be reimbursed\\/refunded."}', '["7","8","10","19","50","132","192","276","288","359","508","514","530","607","608","632","668","689","690","692","714","725","792","796","802","803","815"]', NULL, 'false', '[]', 'false', '1 year from the date of issue', NULL, '[]', '[]', NULL, 'FreshMenu', '', 'a:9:{s:7:"barcode";a:1:{s:8:"encoding";N;}s:15:"redemptionTerms";a:0:{}s:4:"type";s:3:"clp";s:4:"code";s:25:"FreshMenu B2C eGift Cards";s:13:"erupi_purpose";N;s:16:"erupi_payer_type";N;s:16:"erupi_payee_type";N;s:24:"erupi_recurrence_pattern";N;s:14:"erupi_validity";N;}', 'a:7:{s:7:"enabled";b:1;s:15:"payment_methods";a:1:{i:0;s:3:"svc";}s:13:"account_types";a:2:{i:0;s:12:"BANK_ACCOUNT";i:1;s:3:"UPI";}s:17:"transaction_types";a:3:{i:0;s:4:"IMPS";i:1;s:4:"NEFT";i:2;s:3:"UPI";}s:21:"maximum_beneficiaries";s:0:"";s:28:"validate_terms_and_condition";s:0:"";s:10:"validation";a:3:{s:6:"amount";s:1:"1";s:16:"edit_beneficiary";b:1;s:18:"convenience_charge";s:0:"";}}', '[{"code":false}]', 'freshmenu-e-gift-card', '1', '10000', NULL, '2023-12-11 13:37:12', '2019-06-18T11:49:29+00:00', '2023-11-28T19:45:58+00:00', 330),
	(117, 1538, 'EGCGBTCQ001', 'TATA CLiQ E-Gift Card', 'About Tata Cliq: (Pitch)\r\nWant to express yourself with your own unique style? Need a pair of trendy shoes to go with your outfit? How about cool accessories to complete your look? Tata CliQ has it all! With 1200+ brands from India and around the world, Tata CliQ is India’s go to destination for all things fashion, lifestyle and beauty.\r\nWhether you are shopping for yourself or your loved ones, you can always count on Tata CliQ – everything is Hand-piQed and 100% AuthentiQ – sourced straight from the best brands and their authorised resellers from India and across the world.\r\nSo what are you waiting for? Get CliQing!\r\n\r\nProduct description:\r\nTata Cliq makes shopping a magical and memorable experience. One where the digital and physical worlds come together to deliver the best of both to our customers and partners.\r\nWe’re not simply retailing, we\'re reinventing the online shopping experience to make our customers and partners feel special, mesmerized and consistently in awe by delivering a curated, omni-channel shopping experience across fashion, lifestyle, luxury, and beauty.\r\nEverything on Tata Cliq is Hand-piQed and 100% AuthentiQ – sourced straight from the best brands and their authorised resellers from India and across the world.\r\nBut that’s not all - our strong offline brand partner network enables a flexible Phygital experience which combines the ease of shopping online with the reassurance of buying from a brick-and-mortar store - our customers can use our ‘CLiQ and PiQ’ and ‘QUiQ Exchange’ services to pick up or return what they’ve bought, across a pan-India network of more than 1,600 stores and over a hundred partner brands.\r\nExplore. Discover. Experience. Delight. Engage - That’s what we do.\r\nhttps://www.facebook.com/TataCLiQ/\r\nhttps://twitter.com/tatacliq\r\nhttps://www.instagram.com/tatacliq/\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/channel/UCUwkaWqIcl9dYQccKkM0VRA\r\nhttps://in.linkedin.com/company/tatacliq', '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"10","max":"10000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 0, NULL, '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"10","max":"10000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 'DIGITAL', '0', '{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"}', '356', '{"thumbnail":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBTCQ001\\/d\\/thumbnail\\/1538_microsite.jpg","mobile":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBTCQ001\\/d\\/mobile\\/1538_microsite.jpg","base":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBTCQ001\\/d\\/image\\/1538_microsite.jpg","small":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBTCQ001\\/d\\/small_image\\/1538_microsite.jpg"}', '{"link":"https:\\/\\/www.qwikcilver.com\\/terms-and-conditions","content":"These terms and conditions apply to Tata CLiQ Gift Cards (\\"Gift Cards\\") issued by Pine Labs Private Limited (\\"Pine Labs\\") which is a private limited company organized under the laws of India, and is the issuer of Gift Cards. Your purchase or use of Gift Card constitutes your agreement to follow and be bound by these terms and conditions, as updated or modified from time to time. The Gift cards are issued under the brand name of \\u201cQwikcilver\\u201d. <br\\/>Redemption. Gift Cards may only be redeemed toward the purchase of eligible products on www.tatacliq.com. Purchases are deducted from the redeemer\'s Gift Card balance. Any unused Gift Card balance will remain associated with the redeemer\'s tatacliq.com account and applied to purchases in order of earliest expiration date. A redeemer can use multiple Gift Cards in a transaction. If a purchase exceeds the redeemer\'s Gift Card balance, the remaining amount must be paid with by credit card, net banking or debit card. No fees or charges apply to Gift Cards. Pine Labs may provide Gift Card purchasers with information about the redemption status of Gift Cards that they purchase or use. <br\\/>Gift Cards, including any unused Gift Card balances, expire one year from the date of issuance of the respective Gift Card. Gift Cards may only be purchased in denominations ranging from Rs. 10 to Rs. 10,000, or such other limits as Pine Labs may determine. Gift Cards cannot be used to purchase other gift cards. Gift Cards cannot be reloaded, transferred for value or redeemed for cash. Unused Gift Card balances associated with a tatacliq.com account may not be transferred to another tatacliq.com account. No interest will be payable by Pine Labs on any Gift Card or Gift Card balance. Pine Labs makes no representation or warranty that www.tatacliq.com will always be accessible without interruption. <br\\/>Fraud. Pine Labs is not responsible if a Gift Card is lost, stolen, destroyed or used without permission. Tata UniStore Limited (\\"Tata CLiQ\\") will have the right to close customer accounts and take payment from alternative forms of payment if a fraudulently obtained Gift Card is redeemed and\\/or used to make purchases on www.tatacliq.com. <br\\/>Governing Law and Jurisdiction. These terms and conditions are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of India. You, Pine Labs and Tata CLiQ each agree to submit to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts at Mumbai. You agree to indemnify Pine Labs and Tata CLiQ for all claims brought by a third party against it or its affiliates arising out of or in connection with a breach of any of these terms and conditions. <br\\/>Limitation of Liability. NEITHER PINE LABS NOR TATA CLiQ MAKE ANY WARRANTIES, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, WITH RESPECT TO GIFT CARDS, INCLUDING WITHOUT LIMITATION, ANY EXPRESS OR IMPLIED WARRANTY OF MERCHANTABILITY OR FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE. IN THE EVENT A GIFT CARD IS NON-FUNCTIONAL, YOUR SOLE REMEDY WILL BE THE REPLACEMENT OF SUCH GIFT CARD. IF APPLICABLE LAW DOES NOT ALLOW LIMITATIONS ON IMPLIED WARRANTIES OR THE EXCLUSION OR LIMITATION OF CERTAIN DAMAGES, SOME OR ALL OF THE ABOVE DISCLAIMERS, EXCLUSIONS, OR LIMITATIONS MAY NOT APPLY TO YOU, AND YOU MAY HAVE ADDITIONAL RIGHTS. <br\\/>General Terms. The tatacliq.com Conditions of Use apply to Gift Cards. Pine Labs reserves the right to change these Gift Card terms and conditions from time to time in its discretion and without prior notice to you. All terms and conditions are applicable to the extent permitted by law. <br\\/>Pine Labs Contact Information. Customer Service contact number: 1800 102 4438. Website address: www.qwikcilver.com <br\\/>Every holder of Gift Cards shall be required to add the value stored on such Gift Card into the Tata Cliq Wallet\\/Tata Cliq User Account as a pre-requisite to the redemption of the Gift Cards. The loading of the Gift Card onto the Tata Cliq Wallet\\/User Account shall constitute a registration of the User. <br\\/>Tata Cliq (Tata Unistore Ltd) shall honour and consider requests for blocking of Gift Cards only from users who have registered in accordance with the terms above. <br\\/>Please refer the Customer Grievance policy for dispute resolution, unauthorized transactions and liability related aspects at https:\\/\\/www.qwikcilver.com\\/grievance-policy\\/. <br\\/>The cardholder may request for the revalidation of the expired Gift Card. Upon receipt of such request the Gift Card may be revalidated after due verification and maybe subject to additional terms and conditions."}', '["7","8","10","50","132","192","288","508","525","530","591","594","595","597","598","599","600","601","602","607","608","689","690","721","725","745","759","760","784","792","797","802","803"]', NULL, 'false', '[]', 'false', '1 year from the date of issue.', NULL, '[]', '[]', NULL, 'Tata CLiQ', '', 'a:4:{s:7:"barcode";a:1:{s:8:"encoding";N;}s:15:"redemptionTerms";a:0:{}s:4:"type";s:4:"sclp";s:4:"code";s:24:"TUL SCLP B2B eGift Cards";}'