	(121, 1547, 'EGCGBSP002', 'Speedo E-Gift Card', 'Speedo is the most renowned swimwear brand in the world. It offers complete swim solutions for men, women and kids. Speedo’s large offering caters to competitive swimmers and leisure swimmers. Speedo has been innovating with swim solutions since 1914. Swim is what Speedo does. It’s what they’ve done forever.', '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"250","max":"50000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 0, NULL, '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"250","max":"50000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 'DIGITAL', '0', '{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"}', '356', '{"thumbnail":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBSP002\\/d\\/thumbnail\\/1547_microsite.jpg","mobile":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBSP002\\/d\\/mobile\\/1547_microsite.jpg","base":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBSP002\\/d\\/image\\/1547_microsite.jpg","small":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBSP002\\/d\\/small_image\\/1547_microsite.jpg"}', '{"link":"https:\\/\\/bnc.lt\\/m\\/HinODhcYeY","content":"The holder of this card is deemed to be the beneficiary.<br\\/>Only full redemption of the E card is allowed. NO Partial Redemption <br\\/>Maximum of three gift E cards can be redeemed against single invoice <br\\/>This E gift card cannot be exchanged for cash or cheque.<br\\/>No duplicate will be issued if this card is lost or misplaced.<br\\/>This card cannot be validated once expired.<br\\/>No replacement or compensation is permissible for lost or mutilated or defaced   Gift Card.<br\\/>Any dispute should be referred to the Page Industries Ltd and decision of the company shall be final<br\\/>E Gift Card is valid at only at www.speedo.in <br\\/>Redeemable on all products selling on www.spee