	(126, 1737, 'EGCGBUL002', 'Urban Ladder E-Gift Card', 'Urban Ladder offers a unique selection of stylish, contemporary, and chic furniture online and our stores currently in Bangalore. Our online furniture range includes sofas, beds, dining tables, TV units, wardrobes, dressing tables, and lots more. Furniture is what turns your house into a home. Well-designed furniture is not just functional or utilitarian (for example, tables and desks for work or cabinets and wardrobes for storage) but also a reflection of your taste and style. We have hundreds of furniture designs in solid wood, engineered wood, metal, etc.as well as soft furnishings and home decor items.', '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"1000","max":"10000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 0, NULL, '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"1000","max":"10000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 'DIGITAL', '0', '{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"}', '356', '{"thumbnail":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBUL002\\/d\\/thumbnail\\/1737_microsite.jpg","mobile":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBUL002\\/d\\/mobile\\/1737_microsite.jpg","base":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBUL002\\/d\\/image\\/1737_microsite.jpg","small":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBUL002\\/d\\/small_image\\/1737_microsite.png"}', '{"link":"https:\\/\\/woohoo.app.link\\/e\\/zmcVOAwm5tb","content":"Gift Cards once purchased cannot be cancelled or refunded.<br\\/>Gift Card can be availed only for the serviceable locations of Reliance Retail Limited which can be checked on www.urbanlader.com<br\\/>Gift Card Issuer or Reliance Retail Limited will not be held responsible in any circumstances if gift card is applied for a delivery at an unserviceable location<br\\/>Gift Cards