	(138, 1960, 'EGCGBO2SS001', 'O2 Spa Salon E-Gift Card', 'O2Spa Salon is the largest day Spa chain in India and are present at over 40 locations, across 21 cities in India. In a short span of 8 years, the brand has become synonymous with wellness and salon services of global standards.O2 Spa, the pioneer in offering SPA services in India, has introduced several innovative SPA practices that enhance the user experience and has revolutionized Spa services at airports. They have transformed Indian airport operations by introducing the SPA as a must have for any major airport. With air traffic touching new highs every month, O2 SPA offers enhanced convenience of Spa services to air passengers traveling to India and within India O2 Spa is honored with THE BEST NATIONAL SPA CHAIN OF THE YEAR-2017, in the Indian Salon & Wellness Awards.Awarded with the certificate of excellence in the category of OUTLET OF THE YEAR-2016 by IGI Airport, Delhi.', '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"500","max":"10000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 0, NULL, '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"500","max":"10000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 'DIGITAL', '0', '{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"}', '356', '{"thumbnail":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBO2SS001\\/d\\/thumbnail\\/1960_microsite.jpg","mobile":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBO2SS001\\/d\\/mobile\\/1960_microsite.jpg","base":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBO2SS001\\/d\\/image\\/1960_microsite.jpg","small":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBO2SS001\\/d\\/small_image\\/1960_microsite.jpg"}', '{"link":"https:\\/\\/woohoo.app.link\\/e\\/DAVRybwxY4","content":"The gift card is not a legal tender or replacement of credit \\/ debit card<br\\/>This card ca