	(141, 2204, 'EGCGBRB001', 'Ray-Ban E-Gift Cards', 'From the early Aviator style that emerged in 1937 to the introduction of the classic Wayfarer in 1952, Ray-Ban is a brand that embodies adventure, heroism, individuality, and authenticity. Starting with a silver screen debut in 1961, Ray-Ban sunglasses have appeared throughout hundreds of films. With timeless and imaginative styles, Ray-Ban consistently blends high-tech design, lenses, and materials. The collection remains true to its classic heritage while continuously evolving to meet today\'s fashion demands', '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"500","max":"10000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 0, NULL, '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"500","max":"10000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 'DIGITAL', '0', '{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"}', '356', '{"thumbnail":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBRB001\\/d\\/thumbnail\\/2204_microsite.jpg","mobile":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBRB001\\/d\\/mobile\\/2204_microsite.jpg","base":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBRB001\\/d\\/image\\/2204_microsite.jpg","small":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBRB001\\/d\\/small_image\\/2204_microsite.jpg"}', '{"link":"https:\\/\\/woohoo.app.link\\/e\\/mffL0mUk7tb","content":"The gift card is not a legal tender or replacement of credit \\/ debit card<br\\/>This card cannot be exchanged for cash or cheque.<br\\/>The holder of this card is deemed to be the beneficiary<br\\/>This Gift Card is valid at only at https:\\/\\/www.ray-ban.com\\/india <br\\/>Maximum of five gift cards can be redeemed against single invoice <br\\/>No replacement or compensation is permissible for lost or mutilated or defaced Gift Card<br\\/>Valid for six months (180 days) from