	(142, 2206, 'EGCGBLUH001', 'Lulu Hypermarket E-Gift Cards', 'LuLu Hypermarket is the retail division of the multidimensional and multinational LuLu Group International.\r\nLULU GROUP INTERNATIONAL (LuLu Group) is a highly diversified conglomerate with successful business entities in strategic locations worldwide. Headquartered in Abu Dhabi, the capital of the United Arab Emirates, it is a world-renowned purveyor of an international business portfolio that ranges from hypermarket operations to shopping mall development, manufacturing and trading of goods, hospitality assets, and real estate. LuLu Group mainly operates in 22 countries located across the Middle East, Asia, US, and Europe.', '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"50","max":"10000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 0, NULL, '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"50","max":"10000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 'DIGITAL', '0', '{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"}', '356', '{"thumbnail":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBLUH001\\/d\\/thumbnail\\/2206_microsite.jpg","mobile":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBLUH001\\/d\\/mobile\\/2206_microsite.jpg","base":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBLUH001\\/d\\/image\\/2206_microsite.jpg","small":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBLUH001\\/d\\/small_image\\/2206_microsite.jpg"}', '{"link":"https:\\/\\/woohoo-web.app.link\\/e\\/p5CVS9QE4Eb","content":"Customer is deemed to have read the terms and conditions hereunder along with the privacy policy and agrees to comply with the same.<br\\/>E-Gift Card will be accepted in Lulu Hypermarket, Lulu Fashion Store, Lulu Connect, Lulu Celebrate, Lulu Xpress, Lulu Daily and Lulu Webstore (Online) across India.  (Henceforth \\u201cLulu\\u201d)<br\\/>E-gift Card is valid only for one year from the date of activation and shall cease to be valid from the date of expiry. <br\\/>E-Gift Card cannot be exchanged for cash. No cash refund in part\\/full will be provided.<br\\/>Lulu will not be responsible for any loss\\/misuse of E-Gift Card, Password\\/PIN and no demand for reissue\\/ compensation for the loss will be entertained.<br\\/>Once the E-Gift Card is issued\\/redeemed, request for cancellation will not be entertained.<br\\/>Should the purchase value exceed the value of the e-Gift Card, the differential value should be paid by the customer who redeems the e-Gift Card.<br\\/>All taxes, duties, levies or other statutory dues and charges payable in connection with the benefits accruing for the E-Gift Card, shall be borne solely by the Customer.<br\\/>E-Gift Cards are valid for one time redemption only. Any balance amount in the E-Gift Card after the card is redeemed will be forfeited. No further Claim for the balance amount in the E-Gift Card will be entertained.<br\\/>Multiple E-Gift Cards can be used for Single purchase.<br\\/>The holder of the E- Gift card is deemed to be the beneficiary.<br\\/>Lulu reserves unconditional right to cancel the E-Gift Card in the event the Customer breaches these terms of use of the E-Gift Card, and the terms and conditions of Lulu. <br\\/>Lulu reserves the right to alter any\\/all the terms and conditions of this E-Gift Card at any time without prior notice. Any dispute\\/Grievance shall be addressed to Lulu International Shopping Malls Private Limited, 34\\/1000, NH-47, Edappally, Kochi, Kerala-682024, Email Id: customercareindia@luluhypermarket.in,  Grievance officer: Mr. Mohammed Salih Ph: 0484 6676666. Website: www.luluhypermarket.in.<br\\/>E-Gift Cards are normally delivered instantly. Due to system errors, the delivery can be delayed up-to 24 - 48 hours.<br\\/>Data Privacy Consent: The Customer hereby explicitly and unambiguously consents to the collection, use and transfer, in electronic or other form, of the Customer\\u2019s personal data, Phone Number, Email Id and any other materials as applicable by Lulu, its Subsidiaries or Affiliates, for the exclusive purpose of implementing, administering and managing E-Gift card transaction and other sales promotion and marketing.<br\\/>The Customer hereby agrees to indemnify and keep Lulu harmless against all damages, liabilities, costs, expenses, claims, suits and proceedings that may be suffered by Lulu as a consequence of (i) violation of the terms and conditions by the Customer; (ii) violation of applicable laws; (iii) any action or inaction resulting in wilful misconduct or negligence on the Customer\\u2019s part.<br\\/>Governing Law and Jurisdiction: These terms and conditions are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of India and Courts of Ernakulam shall have exclusive jurisdiction."}', '["7","10","50","132","192","276","288","487","607","608","610","614","689","690","796","815"]', NULL, 'false', '[]', 'false', '365 days from date of activation', NULL, '[]', '[]', NULL, 'Lulu Hypermarket', '', 'a:9:{s:7:"barcode";a:1:{s:8:"encoding";N;}s:15:"redemptionTerms";a:0:{}s:4:"type";s:3:"clp";s:4:"code";s:27:"Lulu Hypermarket eGift Card";s:13:"erupi_purpose";N;s:16:"erupi_payer_type";N;s:16:"erupi_payee_type";N;s:24:"erupi_recurrence_pattern";N;s:14:"erupi_validity";N;}', 'a:7:{s:7:"enabled";b:1;s:15:"payment_methods";a:1:{i:0;s:3:"svc";}s:13:"account_types";a:2:{i:0;s:12:"BANK_ACCOUNT";i:1;s:3:"UPI";}s:17:"transaction_types";a:3:{i:0;s:4:"IMPS";i:1;s:4:"NEFT";i:2;s:3:"UPI";}s:21:"maximum_beneficiaries";s:0:"";s:28:"validate_terms_and_condition";s:0:"";s:10:"validation";a:3:{s:6:"amount";s:1:"1";s:16:"edit_beneficiary";b:1;s:18:"convenience_charge";s:0:"";}}', '[{"code":false}]', 'lulu-hypermarket-e-gift-cards', '50', '10000', NULL, '2023-12-11 13:37:22', '2020-06-01T12:27:25+00:00', '2023-11-02T18:38:07+00:00', 330),
	(143, 2289, 'EGCGBPCHR001', 'The Postcard Hotels E-Gift Cards', 'The Postcard Hotel is a collection of intimate luxury hotels hidden in holiday destinations across India, Sri Lanka & Bhutan. Each of our hotels is chosen and designed to take you to a world where holidays were simple and filled with beautiful experiences. Where holidays are slow, free of complications and sun-kissed. Where the romance, charm and simplicity of holidays meets contemporary needs, both in design and impeccable service. \r\nBut we’re more. Neighbourhoods and local communities are the soul of our hotels. Our hotels are sustainably made, our food is made with fresh local ingredients and you won’t be greeted with any sugary welcome drink on arrival. Quite simply, if it is not authentic, it is not in the hotel. \r\nThe Postcard is led by a group of carefully chosen hospitality talent that has experience in the best hospitality names in India and the world. Which means, you’re looked after by the best, from check in to check out. \r\nAll that’s left for you to do, is to try it for yourself. We look forward to welcoming you at The Postcard Hotel.', '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"3000","max":"5000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 0, NULL, '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"3000","max":"5000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 'DIGITAL', '0', '{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"}', '356', '{"thumbnail":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBPCHR001\\/d\\/thumbnail\\/2289_microsite.jpg","mobile":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBPCHR001\\/d\\/mobile\\/2289_microsite.jpg","base":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBPCHR001\\/d\\/image\\/2289_microsite.jpg","small":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBPCHR001\\/d\\/small_image\\/2289_microsite.jpg"}', '{"link":"https:\\/\\/woohoo.app.link\\/e\\/UTnwRURHT7","content":"The e-card balance may be redeemed for spends towards rooms, food and beverages, spa and other services and applicable taxes at Postcard Hotels in India, except for hired services from third party sources, or expenses of a personal nature for which a pay-out is raised such as buying medicines, repairs of personal items, etc. <br\\/>The e-cards are valid for 365 days from the date of issuance. Valid e-card can be reloaded till their expiry date on www.postcardresorts.com\\/giftcards, till a maximum balance of \\u20b9200,000, except where e-cards may be issued by a third party other than The Postcard Hotel or as part of a promotion or offer. E-cards would be automatically revalidated for 365 days from the date of load or reload. Revalidation requests would not be processed outside these terms. <br\\/>Multiple transactions can be performed on the e-cards until the value of the e-card is exhausted.<br\\/>Should your purchase value exceed the e-card value, the differential amount of such purchase may be loaded on the e-card, or should be paid at the point of sale in cash or through an accepted credit or debit card, at the time of making such purchase. <br\\/>A valid e-card must be presented at the time of availing a service. <br\\/>For prepaid room reservations at Postcard Hotels through the central reservation the e-card number and PIN must be quoted when making the reservation. The entire amount must be paid via the e-card to secure the reservation. In case the e-card balance is less than the due amount, the e-card may be reloaded on www.postcardresorts.com\\/giftcards before processing the reservation. Standard cancellation policies would apply. Please contact Postcard Hotel central reservations to process any eligible refunds from cancellations on your e-card.<br\\/>The e-card shall not be valid for use at any other service establishment or for withdrawal of cash.<br\\/>No refund, replacement or cash back would be considered against the e-card. Once an e-card is issued, the company will not entertain any request for cancellation.<br\\/>The Postcard Hotel e-cards are cash equivalent bearer cards. The company is not responsible for and will not replace lost or stolen cards. <br\\/>Redemption of the e-card by its bearer shall be valid discharge of the company\'s liabilities in respect of the e-card. <br\\/>Any dispute needs to be referred to The Postcard Hotels & Resorts and the decision of the company shall be final. <br\\/>Any further dispute related to the card shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of courts at Delhi. <br\\/>The e-card is subject to applicable laws. The company, purchaser and the card bearer shall comply with all applicable laws promulgated by any statutory\\/judicial\\/competent authority from time to time in this regard.<br\\/>The company reserves the entitlement to amend these terms and conditions from time to time. Any change in these terms and conditions can be viewed on our website.<br\\/>For any other queries, please call central reservations +91 7999555222 or e-mail book@postcardresorts.com <br\\/>E-Gift cards are normally delivered instantly. But sometimes due to system issues, the delivery can be delayed up-to 24 - 48 hours. <br\\/>No returns and no refunds of e-gift cards is applicable."}', '["7","10","49","126","132","147","192","276","288","359","607","608","610","628","689","690","692","710","792","798"]', NULL, 'false', '[]', 'false', '365 days from the date of issue', NULL, '[]', '[]', NULL, 'The Postcard Hotels and Resorts', '', 'a:9:{s:7:"barcode";a:1:{s:8:"encoding";N;}s:15:"redemptionTerms";a:0:{}s:4:"type";s:3:"clp";s:4:"code";s:30:"The Postcard Hotels eGift Card";s:13:"erupi_purpose";N;s:16:"erupi_payer_type";N;s:16:"erupi_payee_type";N;s:24:"erupi_recurrence_pattern";N;s:14:"erupi_validity";N;}', 'a:7:{s:7:"enabled";b:1;s:15:"payment_methods";a:1:{i:0;s:3:"svc";}s:13:"account_types";a:2:{i:0;s:12:"BANK_ACCOUNT";i:1;s:3:"UPI";}s:17:"transaction_types";a:3:{i:0;s:4:"IMPS";i:1;s:4:"NEFT";i:2;s:3:"UPI";}s:21:"maximum_beneficiaries";s:0:"";s:28:"validate_terms_and_condition";s:0:"";s:10:"validation";a:3:{s:6:"amount";s:1:"1";s:16:"edit_beneficiary";b:1;s:18:"convenience_charge";s:0:"";}}', '[{"code":false}]', 'the-postcard-hotels-e-gift-cards', '3000', '5000', NULL, '2023-12-11 13:37:22', '2020-07-06T10:42:17+00:00', '2023-11-28T09:33:56+00:00', 330),
	(144, 2409, 'EGCGBAE001', 'American Eagle E-Gift Card', 'American Eagle Outfitters® (NYSE: AEO) is a leading global specialty retailer offering high-quality and on-trend clothing. We are an inclusive, optimistic and empowering company that celebrates the individuality of our customers and associates. Our purpose is to show the world that there’s REAL power in the optimism of youth.', '{"price":"SLAB","type":"SLAB","min":"500","max":"5000","denominations":["500","1000","1500","2000","2500","5000"],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 0, NULL, '{"price":"SLAB","type":"SLAB","min":"500","max":"5000","denominations":["500","1000","1500","2000","2500","5000"],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 'DIGITAL', '0', '{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"}', '356', '{"thumbnail":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBAE001\\/d\\/thumbnail\\/2409_microsite.jpg","mobile":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBAE001\\/d\\/mobile\\/2409_microsite.jpg","base":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBAE001\\/d\\/image\\/2409_microsite.jpg","small":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBAE001\\/d\\/small_image\\/2409_microsite.jpg"}', '{"link":"https:\\/\\/woohoo.app.link\\/e\\/yLX6Ocdl7tb","content":"This EGC shall have a validity period of 1 year from the date of issuance<br\\/>This E- Gift Card is redeemable on all merchandise at aeo.in and all exclusive American Eagle Outfitters stores across India<br\\/>This E- Gift Card can be redeemed just once<br\\/>This E- Gift Card holds no value until activated with a minimum purchase.<br\\/>There is no extra fee to obtain this card<br\\/>Please present the print out of this E- Gift Card to the customer relationship officer prior to billing or when you want to redeem the card when shopping from stores <br\\/>Please use the card number and PIN for the E-Gift Card when shopping online <br\\/>This card is not redeemable for cash or credit.<br\\/>In case of a damaged card, a new card will be issued and loaded with the remaining value only after proof and authenticity is presented to any AE store.<br\\/>If a card is lost or stolen neither will a new card be issued nor will the money be reimbursed in any manner.<br\\/>E-Gift Cards are normally delivered instantly. But sometimes due to system issues, the delivery can be delayed up-to 24 hours."}', '["7","10","14","50","132","192","276","288","359","607","608","610","611","689","690","692","693","792","798"]', NULL, 'false', '[]', 'false', '365 days from the date of issue', NULL, '[]', '[]', NULL, 'American Eagle', '', 'a:9:{s:7:"barcode";a:1:{s:8:"encoding";N;}s:15:"redemptionTerms";a:0:{}s:4:"type";s:3:"clp";s:4:"code";s:26:"American Eagle eGift Cards";s:13:"erupi_purpose";N;s:16:"erupi_payer_type";N;s:16:"erupi_payee_type";N;s:24:"erupi_recurrence_pattern";N;s:14:"erupi_validity";N;}', 'a:7:{s:7:"enabled";b:1;s:15:"payment_methods";a:1:{i:0;s:3:"svc";}s:13:"account_types";a:2:{i:0;s:12:"BANK_ACCOUNT";i:1;s:3:"UPI";}s:17:"transaction_types";a:3:{i:0;s:4:"IMPS";i:1;s:4:"NEFT";i:2;s:3:"UPI";}s:21:"maximum_beneficiaries";s:0:"";s:28:"validate_terms_and_condition";s:0:"";s:10:"validation";a:3:{s:6:"amount";s:1:"1";s:16:"edit_beneficiary";b:1;s:18:"convenience_charge";s:0:"";}}', '[{"code":false}]', 'american-eagle-e-gift-card', '500', '5000', NULL, '2023-12-11 13:37:23', '2020-08-11T12:47:09+00:00', '2023-12-01T15:18:15+00:00', 330),
	(145, 2430, 'EGCGBGUP001', 'Gupta Distributors E-Gift Card', 'Gupta Distributors was just a small shop in 1972 when it started growing because of its reputation as a well trusted brand dealing in electronic and digital products. It has already been 46 years of giving service to this beautiful state. Gupta Distributors might now have the largest chain of electronic retail showrooms in all of Odisha, with the largest variety of products sold.\r\n\r\nMoreover, GD’s spacious showrooms will allow you to stroll around and look at products comfortably. From latest models of laptops to digital cameras to washing machines - you will find every electronic product here! Avail special discounts on a huge range of products. GD also give assured gifts to their customers with every purchase, so that anyone who purchases from their showroom goes back home content and gets value for money and more', '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"500","max":"10000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 0, NULL, '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"500","max":"10000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 'DIGITAL', '0', '{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"}', '356', '{"thumbnail":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBGUP001\\/d\\/thumbnail\\/2430_microsite.jpg","mobile":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBGUP001\\/d\\/mobile\\/2430_microsite.jpg","base":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBGUP001\\/d\\/image\\/2430_microsite.jpg","small":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBGUP001\\/d\\/small_image\\/2430_microsite.jpg"}', '{"link":"https:\\/\\/woohoo.app.link\\/e\\/CH81RaOl7tb","content":"The E-gift card is not a legal tender or replacement of credit \\/ debit card.<br\\/>This E-card cannot be exchanged for cash or cheque.<br\\/>The holder of this E-card is deemed to be the beneficiary.<br\\/>This E-Gift card is valid for 12 months from the date of issue and cannot be revalidated.<br\\/>This E-Gift card can be redeemed only at Gupta Distributors Offline Retail Outlets.<br\\/>This E-Gift card can be redeemed multiple times till balance gets exhausted or card gets expired. Two or more cards can be clubbed for single purchase.<br\\/>If the value of purchase bill is less than the value of E-gift card the balance is non-refundable.<br\\/>E-Gift card bought once cannot be returned\\/refunded.<br\\/>Gupta Distributors reserves the right to alter or suspend any gift card presented against a purchase, if they deem, at their sole discretion, provided that the code has been forged, defaced, or otherwise tempered.<br\\/>In case of return or refund, amount will be credited to customer\\u2019s E-gift card.<br\\/>Gupta Distributors reserve the right to discontinue the E-gift card as product without any prior notice.<br\\/>Any dispute should be referred to Bhubaneswar jurisdiction and the decision of the company shall be final."}', '["7","8","10","50","53","132","192","276","288","607","608","610","619","689","690","692","701","796","802","803"]', NULL, 'false', '[]', 'false', '12 Months from the date of issue', NULL, '[]', '[]', NULL, 'Gupta Distributors', '', 'a:9:{s:7:"barcode";a:1:{s:8:"encoding";N;}s:15:"redemptionTerms";a:0:{}s:4:"type";s:3:"clp";s:4:"code";s:29:"Gupta Distributors eGift Card";s:13:"erupi_purpose";N;s:16:"erupi_payer_type";N;s:16:"erupi_payee_type";N;s:24:"erupi_recurrence_pattern";N;s:14:"erupi_validity";N;}', 'a:7:{s:7:"enabled";b:1;s:15:"payment_methods";a:1:{i:0;s:3:"svc";}s:13:"account_types";a:2:{i:0;s:12:"BANK_ACCOUNT";i:1;s:3:"UPI";}s:17:"transaction_types";a:3:{i:0;s:4:"IMPS";i:1;s:4:"NEFT";i:2;s:3:"UPI";}s:21:"maximum_beneficiaries";s:0:"";s:28:"validate_terms_and_condition";s:0:"";s:10:"validation";a:3:{s:6:"amount";s:1:"1";s:16:"edit_beneficiary";b:1;s:18:"convenience_charge";s:0: