	(146, 2448, 'EGCGBTSR001', 'Imagine Apple Premium Reseller E-Gift Card', 'Imagine lives and breathes Apple. Imagine is the best place to get your hands on all Apple Products, get online demonstrations of the latest Apple products, or attend training and events based around the latest technology.\r\nImagine offers a wide range of Apple products and third party accessories. Our stores have the assortment of accessories to help buyers get the most out of the product range. Whether you are looking for a MacBook sleeve or an iPad case, the latest Mac accessories or latest music accessories, the store stocks a huge range of accessories for Mac, iPad, Apple Watch and iPhone.\r\nThe Imagine Store also has trained staff to guide you best on the Apple product and accessories. Our endeavour at Imagine is to provide the best possible service in terms of customer experience. At the Imagine Store, knowledgeable salespeople are available to help customers learn about all the latest products from Apple. The hands-on store experience provides visitors with a chance to test-drive entire product line. Our endeavour is to provide training to people, so that people understand the power of Mac and apply it in their respective fields.', '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"500","max":"75000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 0, NULL, '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"500","max":"75000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 'DIGITAL', '0', '{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"}', '356', '{"thumbnail":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBTSR001\\/d\\/thumbnail\\/2448_microsite.jpg","mobile":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBTSR001\\/d\\/mobile\\/2448_microsite.jpg","base":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBTSR001\\/d\\/image\\/2448_microsite.jpg","small":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBTSR001\\/d\\/small_image\\/2448_microsite.jpg"}', '{"link":"https:\\/\\/woohoo.app.link\\/e\\/POpLuoc07xb","content":"Imagine Gift Cards issued by Tresor Systems Pvt. Ltd<br\\/>The e-gift card is not a legal tender or replacement of credit \\/ debit card<br\\/>This e-gift card cannot be exchanged for cash or cheque<br\\/>The holder of this e-gift card is deemed to be the beneficiary<br\\/>This E-Gift card is valid for 1 year from the date of issue and cannot be revalidated.<br\\/>This E-Gift card can be redeemed at the Apple Imagine Store and at www.myimaginestore.com<br\\/>Only one card can be redeemed in a single invoice, and a gift card can only be redeemed successfully one time.<br\\/>E-Gift card cannot be exchanged for cash\\/gift card\\/credit notes. If the value of purchase is less than the value of the gift card the balance is non-refundable. And, such cards can\'t be reused to buy any other item from the balance amount. <br\\/>Imagine an E-Gift Card bought once cannot be returned\\/refunded.<br\\/>Tresor Systems Pvt. Ltd. reserves the right to alter or suspend any gift card presented against a purchase, if they deem, at their sole discretion, provided that the code has been forged, defaced, or otherwise tempered<br\\/>Tresor Systems Pvt. Ltd. reserve the right to discontinue the gift card as product without any prior notice<br\\/>No returns and no refunds on Gift Cards, E- gift Cards and Gift Cards issued by Tresor Systems Pvt Ltd.<br\\/>Any dispute should be referred to Delhi jurisdiction and the decision of the company shall be final<br\\/>Any redemption issues related queries customer needs to get in touch with Imagine customer care or write to alisha@myimaginestore.com<br\\/>E-Gift Cards are normally delivered instantly. But sometimes due to system issues, the delivery can be delayed up-to 24 - 48 hours.<br\\/>No returns and no refunds on gift cards."}', '["7","8","10","50","53","132","192","276","288","607","608","610","619","689","690","692","701","792","796","815"]', NULL, 'false', '[]', 'false', '1 year from the date of issue.', NULL, '[]', '[]', NULL, ' Imagine Apple Premium Reseller', '', 'a:9:{s:7:"barcode";a:1:{s:8:"encoding";N;}s:15:"redemptionTerms";a:0:{}s:4:"type";s:3:"clp";s:4:"code";s:18:"Tresor eGift Cards";s:13:"erupi_purpose";N;s:16:"erupi_payer_type";N;s:16:"erupi_payee_type";N;s:24:"erupi_recurrence_pattern";N;s:14:"erupi_validity";N;}', 'a:7:{s:7:"enabled";b:1;s:15:"payment_methods";a:1:{i:0;s:3:"svc";}s:13:"account_types";a:2:{i:0;s:12:"BANK_ACCOUNT";i:1;s:3:"UPI";}s:17:"transaction_types";a:3:{i:0;s:4:"IMPS";i:1;s:4:"NEFT";i:2;s:3:"UPI";}s:21:"maximum_beneficiaries";s:0:"";s:28:"validate_terms_and_condition";s:0:"";s:10:"validation";a:3:{s:6:"amount";s:1:"1";s:16:"edit_beneficiary";b:1;s:18:"convenience_charge";s:0:"";}}', '[{"code":false}]', 'imagine-apple-premium-reseller-e-gift-card', '500', '75000', NULL, '2023-12-11 13:37:23', '2020-09-02T07:39:32+00:00', '2023-11-02T18:39:56+00:00', 330),
	(147, 2471, 'EGCGBHYAT001', 'Hyatt India E-Gift Card', 'GIFTED MOMENTS BY HYATT\r\nGift inspiring experiences and precious memories with the Gifted Moments by Hyatt e-Gift Card. Whether it’s a relaxing staycation or a weekend getaway, a meal at one of our world-class restaurants, or a locally-inspired spa experience, the Gifted Moments by Hyatt e-Gift Card is a thoughtful way to let someone know you care about them.\r\nGifted Moments for Hyatt is valid for use at Hyatt Hotels in India only and can be purchased using credit cards/ debit cards issued by banks in India. The e-Gift Card will be delivered instantly to the receiver’s email address shared at the time of purchase.', '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"1000","max":"10000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 0, NULL, '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"1000","max":"10000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 'DIGITAL', '0', '{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"}', '356', '{"thumbnail":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBHYAT001\\/d\\/thumbnail\\/2471_microsite.jpg","mobile":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBHYAT001\\/d\\/mobile\\/2471_microsite.jpg","base":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBHYAT001\\/d\\/image\\/2471_microsite.jpg","small":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBHYAT001\\/d\\/small_image\\/2471_microsite.jpg"}', '{"link":"https:\\/\\/www.qwikcilver.com\\/terms-and-conditions","content":"This Hyatt Gift Card is issued by Pine Labs Private Limited (\\u201cPine Labs\\u201d) under the brand name of Qwikcilver. This Gift Card may be applied to eligible purchases at participating Hyatt hotels in India (for a list of participating hotels please refer [ https:\\/\\/www.qwikcilver.com\\/terms-and-conditions\\/hyatt-hotels]. Gift Card may not be used outside of India. Eligible purchases do not include casino purchases, advanced purchases, deposits, friends and family rates, payments for meetings, catering or group functions, negotiated rates (including volume, group, contracted, or other rates that have been previously negotiated and agreed in writing whether paid on a group or individual basis), and goods\\/services purchased through or provided by third parties, such as online or off-line travel agents. All other purchases made at participating Hyatt hotels in India are eligible. Use of this Gift Card constitutes acceptance of terms. Certain purchases (e.g., hotel stays) may have a minimum age requirement. Subject to these terms, the Gift Card can be redeemed at hotel-operated restaurants, spa, salon or other services provided directly by participating hotel.<br\\/>Hyatt Gift card needs to be registered before use. To register and activate your Hyatt Gift Card, please send a SMS from your mobile phone as follows: SMS ACT CardNumber CardPin FirstName LastName to 90042 13131. The sending of the said message to the designated mobile number and receipt of due acknowledgement thereto, shall constitute registration of the User. Hyatt \\/ Pine Labs shall honor and consider requests for blocking of Gift Cards only from users who have registered in accordance with the terms above.<br\\/>Each Gift Card shall be single use and only one transaction can be performed on Gift Card, unless otherwise required by applicable law.  Partial redemption of a Gift Card shall not be possible.<br\\/>The Gift Card balance is only valid for one (1) year from the date of issuance\\/activation. Gift Card may not be reloaded.<br\\/>Gift Card carries no value until activated. This Gift Card shall be deemed active upon loading of a minimum amount of Rs. 1000. The maximum denomination per card is limited to Rs 10,000 (Rupees ten thousand).<br\\/>No fees or charges apply to purchase or redemption of Gift Cards. Valid Gift Card in its original form has to be presented at the time of availment. Gift Card is issued in Indian Rupees.<br\\/>Gift Card is not returnable, refundable or redeemable for cash, and may not be resold or transferred for value, except to the extent required by law.<br\\/>Lost, stolen or damaged cards will not be cancelled or replaced without card number and proof of purchase.<br\\/>Gift Cards transferred fraudulently, unlawfully, or otherwise in violation of these terms, are subject to cancellation.<br\\/>The cardholder may request for the revalidation of the expired Gift Card. Upon receipt of such request the gift card may be revalidated after due verification and maybe subject to additional terms and conditions.<br\\/>Gift Card and these terms are governed by the laws of India. Any dispute relating to the Gift Card shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of courts at Bangalore. Hyatt and related marks are trademarks of Hyatt International Corporation or its affiliates.<br\\/>Hyatt reserves the right to institute additional security and verification procedures at the time of card redemption for fraud prevention. Hyatt and\\/or Pine Labs reserve the entitlement to amend these terms and conditions from time to time.<br\\/>For complete Terms and Conditions, please visit [ https:\\/\\/www.qwikcilver.com\\/terms-and-conditions\\/hyatt-hotels] and for Check Balance Enquiries the consumers are invited to refer to [ https:\\/\\/www.woohoo.in\\/balenq]. Gift Cards issued by Pine Labs Private Limited. All rights reserved.<br\\/>Please refer the Customer Grievance policy for dispute resolution, unauthorized transactions and liability related aspects at [ https:\\/\\/www.qwikcilver.com\\/grievance-policy\\/].<br\\/>List of participating hotels that accept Hyatt Gift Card:<br\\/>Andaz Delhi<br\\/>Grand Hyatt Kochi Bolgatty<br\\/>Grand Hyatt Goa<br\\/>Grand Hyatt Mumbai<br\\/>Hyatt Centric Candolim Goa<br\\/>Hyatt Place Gurgaon Udyog Vihar<br\\/>Hyatt Place Hyderabad Banjara Hills<br\\/>Hyatt Regency Chandigarh<br\\/>Hyatt Regency Delhi<br\\/>Hyatt Regency Gurgaon<br\\/>Hyatt Regency Lucknow<br\\/>Hyatt Regency Ludhiana<br\\/>Hyatt Ahmedabad<br\\/>Hyatt Centric MG Road Bangalore<br\\/>Hyatt Hyderabad Gachibowli<br\\/>Hyatt Place Hampi<br\\/>Hyatt Place Pune Hinjawadi<br\\/>Hyatt Pune<br\\/>Hyatt Raipur<br\\/>Hyatt Regency Ahmedabad<br\\/>Hyatt Regency Chennai<br\\/>Hyatt Regency Kolkata<br\\/>Hyatt Regency Mumbai<br\\/>Hyatt Regency Pune<br\\/>Park Hyatt Chennai<br\\/>Park Hyatt Hyderabad<br\\/>Alila Fort Bushranger Japiur<br\\/>Alila Diwa Goa<br\\/>Hyatt Regency Thrissur<br\\/>Hyatt Regency Dharamshala<br\\/>Hyatt Regency Amritsar<br\\/>Gift Cards are Issued by Pine Labs under the Brand Name of Qwikcilver"}', '["7","10","50","112","126","132","192","276","288","607","608","610","628","689","690","692","710","721","792","798"]', NULL, 'false', '[]', 'false', '1 year from the date of issue', NULL, '[]', '[]', NULL, 'Hyatt India', '', 'a:4:{s:7:"barcode";a:1:{s:8:"encoding";N;}s:15:"redemptionTerms";a:0:{}s:4:"type";s:4:"sclp";s:4:"code";s:26:"Hyatt India B2B eGift Card";}', 'a:7:{s:7:"enabled";b:1;s:15:"payment_methods";a:1:{i:0;s:3:"svc";}s:13:"account_types";a:2:{i:0;s:12:"BANK_ACCOUNT";i:1;s:3:"UPI";}s:17:"transaction_types";a:3:{i:0;s:4:"IMPS";i:1;s:4:"NEFT";i:2;s:3:"UPI";}s:21:"maximum_beneficiaries";s:0:"";s:28:"validate_terms_and_condition";s:0:"";s:10:"validation";a:3:{s:6:"amount";s:1:"1";s:16:"edit_beneficiary";b:1;s:18:"convenience_charge";s:0:"";}}', '[{"code":false}]', 'hyatt-india-e-gift-card', '1000', '10000', NULL, '2023-12-11 13:37:23', '2020-09-08T13:26:17+00:00', '2023-11-28T09:27:23+00:00', 330),
	(148, 2484, 'EGCGBORZ001', 'Ornaz E-Gift Card', 'Gift your loved one diamond ring of their choice with a Ornaz gift card. With the widest variety of diamond rings and holding biggest inventory of diamonds, there is something for every couple at Ornaz. \r\nOrnaz is India’s First Engagement Ring Brand and provides the widest collection of Designs with capability to fit any design into any Budget using live customization. We provide fastest customization in the industry and designs which you can try virtually also over your hand. We only sell GIA certified diamonds as GIA is world’s biggest certification lab available across the world. Our Mission is to offer consumer the highest quality Engagement Rings and largest selection at Best price.', '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"500","max":"25000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 0, NULL, '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"500","max":"25000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 'DIGITAL', '0', '{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"}', '356', '{"thumbnail":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBORZ001\\/d\\/thumbnail\\/2484_microsite.jpg","mobile":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBORZ001\\/d\\/mobile\\/2484_microsite.jpg","base":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBORZ001\\/d\\/image\\/2484_microsite.jpg","small":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBORZ001\\/d\\/small_image\\/2484_microsite.jpg"}', '{"link":"https:\\/\\/woohoo.app.link\\/e\\/vu8vdj0p7tb","content":"E-Gift Card(s) can be redeemed on purchase of any jewelry products only on Ornaz.com and Ornaz mobile app<br\\/>On the account page, Click on the tab \\"\\"E-Gift Card\\"\\" and enter your 16 digit Gift Card number and pin for redemption.<br\\/>Multiple Gift Card(s) up to three can be used in a single transaction.<br\\/>E-Gift Card(s) can be combined with any other payment type on Ornaz.com.<br\\/>E-Gift cards can also be redeemed partially, as many times as a user wishes to, till its balance is consumed or it expires.<br\\/>E-Gift cards are valid for a period of 1 year from the date of issuance.<br\\/>E-Gift Card(s) once bought online, shall be considered as sold and cannot be Cancelled, Exchanged or Refunded.<br\\/>E-Gift cards cannot be used to purchase another Gift Card. Payment mode will be Net Banking, Credit\\/Debit Card.<br\\/>If lost or misused, the Gift Card(s) cannot be replaced.<br\\/>E-Gift cards are void if resold, and cannot be exchanged for credit(s) or cash and cannot be re-validated once past expiry date.<br\\/>In addition to these Terms and Conditions, Ornaz Gift Card(s) and their use on our website are also subject to Ornaz\\u2019s general Terms of Use & Ornaz\'s decision will be final in case of any dispute.<br\\/>Ornaz may change (add to, delete, or amend) these terms from time to time. Unless stated otherwise, the changes will apply to any new Ornaz gift card.<br\\/>E-Gift Card(s) cannot be redeemed on purchase of gold coins.<br\\/>Any gift cards that you purchase are for personal, non-commercial use and enjoyment only. The same may be shared with family and friends, but may not be advertised, sold or used as promotional items by the purchaser or anyone else without Ornaz\\u2019s prior written consent.<br\\/>All disputes, with respect to the products and services offered in this connection, are subject to Gurugram jurisdiction.<br\\/>E-Gift Cards are normally delivered instantly. But sometimes due to system issues, the delivery can be delayed up-to 24 - 48 hours."}', '["7","8","10","50","55","132","192","258","276","288","383","607","608","610","620","689","690","692","702","792","798"]', NULL, 'false', '[]', 'false', '365 days from the date of issue', NULL, '[]', '[]', NULL, 'Ornaz', '', 'a:9:{s:7:"barcode";a:1:{s:8:"encoding";N;}s:15