	(149, 2492, 'EGCGBRS001', 'Rangoli Sarees E-Gift Card', 'Rangoli, over the years have become a name synonymous with redefined tradition and contemporary high fashion. Rangoli has mastered the art of textile intricacies, impeccable tailoring, and the sheer brilliance of draping a lady. The journey started in the year 1990 with nurturing excellence in a wide range of sarees from Benarasi, Silk, Gadwal to Kota, Khadi, embroidery etc. Salwar suits, gowns, indo westerns and tunics of various colours and ranges grace our collections also. Rangoli also has an ardent affair with colours, hence, the christening.\r\nRangoli currently is present in 5 cities, and has 7 stores in Kolkata, Hyderabad, Chennai, Bangalore, and Vijayawada. None of our stores are franchised and all are owned, managed, and serviced by the Rangoli Group.', '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"500","max":"10000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 0, NULL, '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"500","max":"10000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 'DIGITAL', '0', '{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"}', '356', '{"thumbnail":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBRS001\\/d\\/thumbnail\\/2492_microsite.jpg","mobile":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBRS001\\/d\\/mobile\\/2492_microsite.jpg","base":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBRS001\\/d\\/image\\/2492_microsite.jpg","small":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBRS001\\/d\\/small_image\\/2492_microsite.jpg"}', '{"link":"https:\\/\\/woohoo.app.link\\/e\\/xVB4s7kr7tb","content":"The gift card is not a legal tender or replacement of credit \\/ debit card<br\\/>This card cannot be exchanged for cash or cheque<br\\/>The holder of this card is deemed to be the beneficiary<br\\/>This Gift card is valid for 12 months from the date of issue and cannot be revalidated<br\\/>This Gift card can be redeemed only at Rangoli Outlets  <br\\/>This Gift card can be redeemed multiple times till balance gets exhausted or card gets expired. Two or more cards can be clubbed for single purchase<br\\/>If the value of purchase bill is less than the value of gift card the balance is non-refundable<br\\/>Gift card bought once cannot be returned\\/refunded<br\\/>Rangoli reserves the right to alter or suspend any gift card presented against a purchase, if they deem, at their sole discretion, provided that the code has been forged, defaced, or otherwise tempered<br\\/>In case of return or refund, amount will be credited to customer\\u2019s gift card <br\\/>Rangoli reserve the right to discontinue the gift card as product without any prior notice.<br\\/>Any dispute should be referred to Kolkata jurisdiction and the decision of the company shall be final"}', '["7","10","14","50","132","192","276","288","607","608","610","611","689","690","692","693","792","797"]', NULL, 'true', '[]', 'false', '1 year from date of activation.', NULL, '[]', '[]', NULL, 'Rangoli Sarees', '', 'a:9:{s:7:"barcode";a:1:{s:8:"encoding";N;}s:15:"redemptionTerms";a:0:{}s:4:"type";s:3:"clp";s:4:"code";s:25:"Rangoli Sarees eGift Card";s:13:"erupi_purpose";N;s:16:"erupi_payer_type";N;s:16:"erupi_payee_type";N;s:24:"erupi_recurrence_pattern";N;s:14:"erupi_validity";N;}', 'a:7:{s:7:"enabled";b:1;s:15:"payment_methods";a:1:{i:0;s:3:"svc";}s:13:"account_types";a:2:{i:0;s:12:"BANK_ACCOUNT";i:1;s:3:"UPI";}s:17:"transaction_types";a:3:{i:0;s:4:"IMPS";i:1;s:4:"NEFT";i:2;s:3:"UPI";}s:21:"maximum_beneficiaries";s:0:"";s:28:"validate_terms_and_condition";s:0:"";s:10:"validation";a:3:{s:6:"amount";s:1:"1";s:16:"edit_beneficiary";b:1;s:18:"convenience_charge";s:0:"";}}', '[{"code":false}]', 'rangoli-sarees-e-gift-card', '500', '10000', NULL, '2023-12-11 13:37:24', '2020-09-17T13:30:14+00:00', '2023-11-08T08:42:02+00:00', 330),
	(150, 2507, 'EGCGBITCL006', 'ITC Hotels E-Gift Card', 'Give the gift of indigenous experiences to someone special that they’ll treasure for life. \r\nITC Hotels Gift Card offers you a gateway to create long lasting memories. Whether it’s a relaxing holiday, a symphony of flavours at award-winning restaurants, a rejuvenating spa & salon service or delectable chocolates at Fabelle boutiques, this gift is sure to delight.', '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"1000","max":"10000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 0, NULL, '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"1000","max":"10000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 'DIGITAL', '0', '{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"}', '356', '{"thumbnail":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBITCL006\\/d\\/thumbnail\\/2507_microsite.jpg","mobile":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBITCL006\\/d\\/mobile\\/2507_microsite.jpg","base":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBITCL006\\/d\\/image\\/2507_microsite.jpg","small":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBITCL006\\/d\\/small_image\\/2507_microsite.jpg"}', '{"link":"https:\\/\\/www.qwikcilver.com\\/terms-and-conditions","content":"ITC Hotels E- Gift Card is issued by Pine Labs under the brand name of Qwikcilver.<br\\/>To register and activate your ITC Hotels Gift Card, please send a SMS from your mobile phone as follows: ACT<space>CardNumber<space>CardPin<space>FirstName<space>LastName to 99639 00600. The sending of the said message to the designated mobile number and receipt of due acknowledgement thereto, shall constitute registration of the User. You can also, register by logging in to the SSA portal https:\\/\\/bit.ly\\/3LKH5pi<br\\/>ITC Limited \\/ Pine Labs shall honour and consider requests for blocking of E-Gift Cards only from users who have registered in accordance with the terms of E-Gift Card mentioned below.<br\\/>Valid E-Gift Card in its original form has to be presented at the time of availing a service.<br\\/>E-Gift Card may be used only at participating ITC\\u2019s Hotels Group in India.<br\\/>All E-Gift Cards issued shall have a validity period of 1 year from the date of issuance of cards.<br\\/>This E-Gift Card cannot be transferred for balance value or redeemed for cash.<br\\/>This E-Gift Card is cash equivalent. Pine Labs, ITC Limited or their affiliates are not responsible if this E- Gift Card is lost, stolen or used without permission.<br\\/>No refund, replacement or cash back would be considered against the Gift Card.<br\\/>Reload is not applicable in case of gift card.<br\\/>Any dispute shall be referred to Pine Labs and the decision of Pine Labs will be final.<br\\/>Subject to the foregoing, these terms and conditions shall be subject to the jurisdiction of courts at Gurugram, India.<br\\/>Pine Labs & ITC Limited reserves the entitlement to amend these terms and conditions from time to time. Any change in these terms and conditions can be viewed on our website. https:\\/\\/www.qwikcilver.com\\/terms-and-conditions\\/ No fees or charges apply to Gift Cards.<br\\/>The cardholder may request for the revalidation of the expired gift card. Upon receipt of such request the gift card may be revalidated after due verification and maybe subject to additional terms and conditions. Please refer the Customer Grievance policy for dispute resolution, unauthorized transactions and liability related aspects at https:\\/\\/www.qwikcilver.com\\/grievance-policy\\/<br\\/>Non-receipt of Gift Card post 7 days of receipt of dispatch confirmation has to be reported immediately or else Pine Labs, ITC Limited or their affiliates will not be liable for the misuse of the card.<br\\/>The E-Gift card is valid for spends towards stays (room & incidental charges), food & beverages, Home deliveries & takeaways, spa services (for resident guests only), Fabelle boutiques, Sleeep Boutique and applicable taxes at any of the participating hotels.<br\\/>The E-Gift card is not valid for spends towards settling banquet charges, paid-outs like car transfers, spends at retail or any third party service establishment at participating hotels, or any expenses of personal nature for which a pay-out is raised such as buying medicines, repairs of personal items etc.<br\\/>The E-Gift cards cannot be used to settle stays booked on\\/thru<br\\/>Corporate rates<br\\/>Group rates<br\\/>Online Travel Agents (OTA\\u2019s)<br\\/>Any negotiated room rates<br\\/>Travel Agents\\/Intermediaries<br\\/>Any commission agents<br\\/>The E-Gift card shall not be valid for withdrawal of cash or currency exchange.<br\\/>Multiple transactions can be performed on gift card until the value of the card is exhausted.<br\\/>Should the purchase value exceed the card value, the differential amount of such purchase shall have to be paid at the point of sale either in cash or through an accepted credit or debit card, at the time of making such purchase. International cards are not accepted for the purchase of gift cards.<br\\/>Club ITC Green Points will not be awarded for transaction settled using Gift Cards. However, for transactions settled with a combination of Gift Card and any other eligible payment mode the Club ITC Green Points will be awarded for the differential amount being settled through the alternate payment mode.<br\\/>A card once issued cannot be cancelled or refunded.<br\\/>The E-Gift Card can be purchased for a minimum value of \\u20b9 1000 and maximum value of \\u20b9 10,000 per transaction<br\\/>The E-Gift Card will be delivered instantly to the recipient\'s email address as entered in the form on the same day unless the delivery is scheduled for a particular day.<br\\/>For any queries, balance check and date of expiry please visit https:\\/\\/www.woohoo.in\\/balenq and input the Card Number in the \'Check Balance\' section.<br\\/>In case of theft, kindly report the same to Pine labs. Upon verification of the identity of the guest the card will be blocked and a fresh card will be reissued. The card is a cash equivalent bearer card. Pine labs, ITC Limited & its affiliates shall not be responsible for lost or stolen cards and any misuse thereof. A reissued card shall have the balance validity of the original issued card.<br\\/>Redemption of the card by its bearer shall be valid discharge of Pine Labs & ITC Limited\'s liabilities in respect of the card.<br\\/>The card is subject to applicable laws. The card holder shall comply with all applicable laws promulgated by any statutory\\/judicial\\/competent authority from time to time in this regard.<br\\/>For queries, email at customer.service@itchotels.in or reach us at: The Direct Marketing Cell, ITC Limited-Hotels Division, ITC Green Centre, 10, Institutional Area, Sector 32, Gurgaon-122001<br\\/>List of Participating Hotels: Delhi\\/ NCR - ITC Maurya, ITC Grand Bharat, Sheraton New Delhi | Mumbai - ITC Grand Central, ITC Maratha | Hyderabad - ITC Kakatiya, ITC Kohenur | Kolkata - ITC Royal Bengal, ITC Sonar | Bengaluru - ITC Gardenia, ITC Windsor, Welcomhotel Bengaluru | Agra - ITC Mughal | Jaipur - ITC Rajputana | Goa - ITC Grand Goa | Coimbatore - Welcomhotel Coimbatore | Vadodara - Welcomhotel Vadodara | Amritsar - Welcomhotel Amritsar | Ahmedabad - Fortune Park Ahmedabad | Port Blair - Fortune bay Island, Port Blair | Chennai \\u2013 ITC Grand Chola"}', '["7","8","50","112","132","192","276","288","607","608","689","690","721","792","798","802","803"]', NULL, 'false', '[]', 'false', '12 Months from the date of issue', NULL, '[]', '[]', NULL, 'ITC Limited', '', 'a:4:{s:7:"barcode";a:1:{s:8:"encoding";N;}s:15:"redemptionTerms";a:0:{}s:4:"type";s:4:"sclp";s:4:"code";s:25:"ITC Hotels B2B eGift Card";}', 'a:7:{s:7:"enabled";b:1;s:15:"payment_methods";a:1:{i:0;s:3:"svc";}s:13:"account_types";a:2:{i:0;s:12:"BANK_ACCOUNT";i:1;s:3:"UPI";}s:17:"transaction_types";a:3:{i:0;s:4:"IMPS";i:1;s:4:"NEFT";i:2;s:3:"UPI";}s:21:"maximum_beneficiaries";s:0:"";s:28:"validate_terms_and_condition";s:0:"";s:10:"validation";a:3:{s:6:"amount";s:1:"1";s:16:"edit_beneficiary";b:1;s:18:"convenience_charge";s:0:"";}}', '[{"code":false}]', 'itc-hotels-e-gift-card-2507', '1000', '10000', NULL, '2023-12-11 13:37:25', '2020-09-23T09:05:00+00:00', '2023-11-28T09:27:42+00:00', 330),
	(151, 2572, 'EGCGBCLTVP001', 'The Collective E-Gift Card', 'Welcome to the most thoughtful way to gift something extra-special to someone special. With The Collective’s e-gift cards, you are gifting someone the freedom of choice. They can treat themselves to apparel or accessories from the some of the world’s finest luxury brands – and can pick exactly what they want.\r\nChoose The Collective’s e-card, every time you want to make someone’s day with a #NoOrdinaryGift.', '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"500","max":"100000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 0, NULL, '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"500","max":"100000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 'DIGITAL', '0', '{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"}', '356', '{"thumbnail":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBCLTVP001\\/d\\/thumbnail\\/2572_microsite.jpg","mobile":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBCLTVP001\\/d\\/mobile\\/2572_microsite.jpg","base":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBCLTVP001\\/d\\/image\\/2572_microsite.jpg","small":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBCLTVP001\\/d\\/small_image\\/2572_microsite.jpg"}', '{"link":"https:\\/\\/woohoo.app.link\\/e\\/LoMIWrJs7tb","content":"This E- Gift Card is redeemable on all merchandise at thecollective.in and all exclusive The Collective stores across India (https:\\/\\/www.thecollective.in\\/storelocator)<br\\/>This E- Gift Card can be redeemed just once.<br\\/>This E- Gift Card holds no value until activated with a minimum purchase.<br\\/>There is no extra fee to obtain this card.<br\\/>This e-gift card is valid for period of 6 months from date of activation.<br\\/>Please present the print out of this E- Gift Card to the customer relationship officer prior to billing or when you want to redeem the card when shopping from stores. <br\\/>Please use the card number and PIN for the E-Gift Card when shopping online.<br\\/>This card is not redeemable for cash or credit.<br\\/>In case of a damaged card, a new card will be issued and loaded with the remaining value only after proof and authenticity is presented to any of above mentioned stores.<br\\/>If a card is lost or stolen neither will a new card be issued nor will the money be reimbursed in any manner.<br\\/>E-Gift Cards are normally delivered instantly. But sometimes due to system issues, the delivery can be delayed up-to 24 hours."}', '["7","8","10","14","15","50","132","192","276","288","607","608","610","611","612","689","690","692","693","694","792","797","802","803"]', NULL, 'false', '[]', 'false', '6 Months from the date of issue', NULL, '[]', '[]', NULL, 'The Collective', '', 'a:9:{s:7:"barcode";a:1:{s:8:"encoding";N;}s:15:"redemptionTerms";a:0:{}s:4:"type";s:3:"clp";s:4:"code";s:25:"QC-The Collective-EGC-VAR";s:13:"erupi_purpose";N;s:16:"erupi_payer_type";N;s:16:"erupi_payee_type";N;s:24:"erupi_recurrence_pattern";N;s:14:"erupi_validity";N;}', 'a:7:{s:7:"enabled";b:1;s:15:"payment_methods";a:1:{i:0;s:3:"svc";}s:13:"account_types";a:2:{i:0;s:12:"BANK_ACCOUNT";i:1;s:3:"UPI";}s:17:"transaction_types";a:3:{i:0;s:4:"IMPS";i:1;s:4:"NEFT";i:2;s:3:"UPI";}s:21:"maximum_beneficiaries";s:0:"";s:28:"validate_terms_and_condition";s:0:"";s:10:"validation";a:3:{s:6:"amount";s:1:"1";s:16:"edit_beneficiary";b:1;s:18:"convenience_charge";s:0:"";}}', '[{"code":false}]', 'the-collective-e-gift-card', '500', '100000', NULL, '2023-12-11 13:37:25', '2020-10-12T11:09:45+00:00', '2023-12-01T15:22:49+00:00', 330),
	(152, 2577, 'EGCGBLPE001', 'Louis Philippe E-Gift Card', 'Louis Philippe is a purveyor of fine fashion for the discerning gentleman. The brand stands for precision in craftsmanship that translates into apparel that are classic and contemporary, and perfect for the quintessential man. Louis Philippe, one of the renowned brands from the Aditya Birla Group, has always taken a human-centered approach by understanding the lifestyle requirements of the modern man and evolving new innovations to address them. The ongoing pandemic outbreak resulted in a forced and unforeseen shift in the lifestyle choices of people all over. The smart and expeditious nature of the brand paved the way for Louis Philippe to address them quickly and effectively – and, as always, with the great taste.The elegance, quality, and craftsmanship of Louis Philippe has created a new standard of luxury since its founding. While the brand continues to grow, the qualities that define it are unchanging: outstanding craftsmanship, innovative design, contemporary functionality, making it the finest choice for gifting. With a wide choice of unparalleled luxury clothing, the Louis Philippe Gift Card is an excellent gift, for your friends and family, for any occasion.', '{"price":"SLAB","type":"SLAB","min":"500","max":"10000","denominations":["500","1000","1500","2000","2500","3000","5000","7500","10000"],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 0, NULL, '{"price":"SLAB","type":"SLAB","min":"500","max":"10000","denominations":["500","1000","1500","2000","2500","3000","5000","7500","10000"],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 'DIGITAL', '0', '{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"}', '356', '{"thumbnail":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBLPE001\\/d\\/thumbnail\\/2577_microsite.jpg","mobile":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBLPE001\\/d\\/mobile\\/2577_micro