	(153, 2600, 'EGCGBBS002', 'BlueStone Gold E-Gift Cards', 'Gift your loved one jewellery of their choice with a Bluestone gift card. With a wide variety of jewellery for the entire family – Women, Men & Children, there is something for everyone at Bluestone. Your loved ones can choose certified jewelry in gold, platinum, diamonds from over 4000 designs, with popular and trendy motifs like hearts, floral, peacocks and religious.', '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"500","max":"15000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 0, NULL, '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"500","max":"15000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 'DIGITAL', '0', '{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"}', '356', '{"thumbnail":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBBS002\\/d\\/thumbnail\\/2600_microsite.jpg","mobile":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBBS002\\/d\\/mobile\\/2600_microsite.jpg","base":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBBS002\\/d\\/image\\/2600_microsite.jpg","small":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBBS002\\/d\\/small_image\\/2600_microsite.jpg"}', '{"link":"https:\\/\\/woohoo.app.link\\/e\\/vEyU2uMt7tb","content":"Gift Card(s) can be redeemed on www.bluestone.com and offline stores (www.bluestone.com\\/store.html)<br\\/>Gift card can be redeemed on plain gold jewellery, Gold Coins, Silver Coins, Solitaire, preset Solitaires, Diamond Jewellery and Gemstone Jewellery.<br\\/>On the payment page, Click on the tab \\"Gift Card\\" and enter your 16 digit Gift Card number and pin for redemption.<br\\/>Multiple Gift Card(s) can be used in a single transaction. Gift Card(s) can be combined with any other payment type on www.bluestone.com<br\\/>Gift cards can also be redeemed partially, as many times as a user wishes to, till its b