	(165, 2750, 'EGCGBTS001', 'Tata Play HD New Connection E-Gift Card', 'Tata Sky is the preferred DTH connection service provider in India with 17+ million connections and growing.   \r\nWith the Tata Sky Subscription Card, the user can subscribe to and avail Tata Sky\'s DTH service with over 600+ channels, and record and watch their favorite shows anytime in HD with Dolby quality sound.', '{"price":"SLAB","type":"SLAB","min":"1608","max":"1608","denominations":["1608"],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 0, NULL, '{"price":"SLAB","type":"SLAB","min":"1608","max":"1608","denominations":["1608"],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 'DIGITAL', '0', '{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"}', '356', '{"thumbnail":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBTS001\\/d\\/thumbnail\\/2750_microsite.jpg","mobile":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBTS001\\/d\\/mobile\\/2750_microsite.jpg","base":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBTS001\\/d\\/image\\/2750_microsite.jpg","small":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBTS001\\/d\\/small_image\\/2750_microsite.jpg"}', '{"link":"https:\\/\\/woohoo.app.link\\/e\\/KijJfbGvnsb","content":"The Tata Play HD New Connection e-Gift Card is issued and fulfilled by Secura Technologies, Tata Play\\u2019s authorised National Partner. <br\\/>Tata Play HD New Connection e-Gift Cards are redeemable only at Secura Technologies Call Centre. <br\\/>For redeeming the Tata Play HD New Connection e-Gift Card, the customer will need to give a missed call on 8291020687. Customer will receive a call back within 2 hours during office hours on working days (10am to 6pm, Monday - Saturday) for redeeming the card and processing the order.<br\\/>Tata Play HD New Connection e-Gift Cards are valid for 90 days from the date of issuance. <br\\/>Tata Play HD N