	(172, 2913, 'EGCGBSH001', 'Sterling Holidays E-Gift Card', 'Sterling Holiday Resorts Limited was founded with a dream of making holidays an active part of the Indian consumer’s lifestyle. Our guests have enjoyed priceless holidays at exceptional destinations all across the country for over 30 years. \r\nToday, holidays are much more than accommodation and food. The new age traveller seeks immersive experiential holidays that are more than just the ordinary. Catering to this, our renewed brand promise - ‘Holiday Differently’, presents you with the chance to explore diverse destinations and discover exciting experiences for an unforgettable holiday. With 2200+ rooms spread across 30+ resorts in a myriad of destinations and a host of unique and curated experiences to offer, we are today the country’s leading experiential holiday company.\r\nWe at Sterling, bring together a fusion of warm Indian hospitality and the highest standards of service. Our Service philosophy stands on three key pillars: our People, with passionate and outstanding service, Experiences, that are unique and enriching, and lastly, our Destinations, rich and diverse, each with so much to offer. These are tied into our service philosophy of PEPS (People, Experiences, Places- Spark Joy) and this is exactly what we endeavor to do, spark joy at every interaction, with every action.', '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"1000","max":"50000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 0, NULL, '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"1000","max":"50000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 'DIGITAL', '0', '{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"}', '356', '{"thumbnail":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBSH001\\/d\\/thumbnail\\/2913_microsite.jpg","mobile":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBSH001\\/d\\/mobile\\/2913_microsite.jpg","base":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBSH001\\/d\\/image\\/2913_microsite.jpg","small":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBSH001\\/d\\/small_image\\/2913_microsite.jpg"}', '{"link":"https:\\/\\/woohoo.app.link\\/e\\/vftFkFCmcub","content":"Sterling Holidays Gift Card is powered by Qwikcilver Solutions Private Limited.<\\/li><li>Sterling Holidays \\/ Qwikcilver shall honour and consider requests for blocking of Gift Cards only from users who have registered in accordance with the terms of Gift Card mentioned below.<\\/li><li>Valid Gift Card in its original form (Email\\/SMS) has to be presented at the time of availing a service.<\\/li><li>Gift Card may be used only at participating Sterling Resorts in India against specific services<\\/li><li>All Gift Cards issued shall have a validity period of 1 year from the date of issuance of cards.<\\/li><li>This Gift Card cannot be transferred for balance value or redeemed for cash.<\\/li><li>This Gift Card is cash equivalent. Qwikcilver, Sterling Holidays or their affiliates are not responsible if this Gift Card is lost, stolen or used without permission.<\\/li><li>No refund, replacement or cash back would be considered against the Gift Card.<\\/li><li>Reload is not applicable in case of gift card.<\\/li><li>Any dispute shall be referred to Qwikcilver and the decision of Qwikcilver will be final.<\\/li><li>Subject to the foregoing, these terms and conditions shall be subject to the jurisdiction of courts at Chennai, India.<\\/li><li>Qwikcilver &amp; STERLING HOLIDAYS reserve the entitlement to amend these terms and conditions from time to time. Any change in these terms and conditions can be viewed on our website https:\\/\\/www.qwikcilver.com\\/terms-and-conditions\\/. No fees or charges apply to Gift Cards.<\\/li><li>Qwikcilver, STERLING HOLIDAYS or their affiliates will not be liable for the misuse of the card.<\\/li><li>The card is valid for spends towards stay and applicable taxes at any of the participating Resorts when booked on <a href=\\"https:\\/\\/www.sterlingholidays.com\\/bookings\\">www.sterlingholidays.com<\\/a> website.<\\/li><li>The card is not valid for spends towards settling banquet charges, paid-outs like car transfers, spends at retail or any third party service establishment at participating Resorts, or any expenses of personal nature for which a pay-out is raised such as buying medicines, sightseeing charges etc.<\\/li><li>The Gift Card cannot be used as a deposit,<\\/li><li>The cards cannot be used to settle stays booked on\\/thru<br\\/><ul>a. Corporate rates<br\\/>b. Group rates<br\\/>c. Online Travel Agents (OTA&rsquo;s)<br\\/>d. Any discounted or contracted room rates<br\\/>e. Travel Agents\\/Intermediaries<br\\/>f. Any commission agents<\\/ul><\\/li><li>The Gift Card shall not be applicable for redemption in conjunction with any other offer\\/promotion or benefit(s)<\\/li><li>The card shall not be valid for withdrawal of cash or currency exchange.<\\/li><li>Multiple transactions can be performed on gift card until the value of the card is exhausted.<\\/li><li>Should the purchase value exceed the card value, the differential amount of such purchase shall have to be paid at the point of sale through an accepted credit or debit card, at the time of making a reservation.<\\/li><li>A card once issued cannot be cancelled or refunded.<\\/li><li>The Gift Card can be purchased for a minimum value of \\u20b91000 and maximum value of \\u20b950,000 per transaction. The gift card can also be purchases against a Holiday package as per the inclusions mentioned in the package and can be redeemed only against the same package only<\\/li><li>The Gift Card will be delivered instantly to the recipient&rsquo;s email address as entered in the form on the same day unless the delivery is scheduled for a particular day.<\\/li><li>For any queries, balance check and date of expiry please visit https:\\/\\/www.woohoo.in\\/balenq and input the Card Number in the &lsquo;Check Balance&rsquo; section.<\\/li><li>To check balance and expiry of your Sterling Holidays Gift Card, please send a SMS from your registered mobile number as follows to receive the details via SMS.<\\/li><li>BAL&lt;space&gt;Card Number to 9963900600<\\/li><li>In case of theft, kindly report the same to Qwikcilver. Upon verification of the identity of the guest the card will be blocked and a fresh card will be reissued. The card is a cash equivalent bearer card. Qwikcilver, STERLING HOLIDAYS &amp; its affiliates shall not be responsible for lost or stolen cards and any misuse thereof. A reissued card shall have the balance validity of the original issued card.<\\/li><li>Redemption of the card by its bearer shall be valid discharge of Qwikcilver &amp; Sterling liabilities in respect of the card.<\\/li><li>The card is subject to applicable laws. The card holder shall comply with all applicable laws promulgated by any statutory\\/judicial\\/competent authority from time to time in this regard.<\\/li><li>For queries, email at crs@sterlingholidays.com or call us at 9003302727.<\\/li>"}', '["7","8","10","50","126","132","192","276","288","607","608","610","628","668","689","690","692","710","798","808","809"]', NULL, 'false', '[]', 'false', '12 Months from the date of issue', NULL, '[]', '[]', NULL, 'Sterling Holiday Resorts', '', 'a:9:{s:7:"barcode";a:1:{s:8:"encoding";N;}s:15:"redemptionTerms";a:0:{}s:4:"type";s:3:"clp";s:4:"code";s:27:"Sterling Resorts eGift Card";s:13:"erupi_purpose";N;s:16:"erupi_payer_type";N;s:16:"erupi_payee_type";N;s:24:"erupi_recurrence_pattern";N;s:14:"erupi_validity";N;}', 'a:7:{s:7:"enabled";b:1;s:15:"payment_methods";a:1:{i:0;s:3:"svc";}s:13:"account_types";a:2:{i:0;s:12:"BANK_ACCOUNT";i:1;s:3:"UPI";}s:17:"transaction_types";a:3:{i:0;s:4:"IMPS";i:1;s:4:"NEFT";i:2;s:3:"UPI";}s:21:"maximum_beneficiaries";s:0:"";s:28:"validate_terms_and_condition";s:0:"";s:10:"validation";a:3:{s:6: