	(181, 3271, 'EGVGBBHJ001', 'Bhima Jewellers - Jewellery E-Gift Card', 'Bhima, a legacy established in the year 1925 and pioneer in precious jewellery offering an extensive range of gold, platinum, silver, and diamond jewellery in classic, traditional and contemporary designs. Having over 40 stores across South India and U.A.E. Bhima lives up to its reputation of purity, trust, and fine craftsmanship that has been built over 9 decades. Bhima is committed to providing an exceptional buying experience and an immense range of jewellery to meet your needs for every occasion.', '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"500","max":"50000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 0, NULL, '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"500","max":"50000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 'DIGITAL', '0', '{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"}', '356', '{"thumbnail":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGVGBBHJ001\\/d\\/thumbnail\\/3271_microsite.jpg","mobile":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGVGBBHJ001\\/d\\/mobile\\/3271_microsite.jpg","base":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGVGBBHJ001\\/d\\/image\\/3271_microsite.jpg","small":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGVGBBHJ001\\/d\\/small_image\\/3271_microsite.png"}', '{"link":"https:\\/\\/woohoo.app.link\\/e\\/yPebaitYTBb","content":"The e-Gift card gets activated immediately on purchase and is valid for use for 330 days from the date of activation.<br\\/>This e-Gift card is valid on the purchase of Gold, Silver and Platinum jewellery only. In case, during a transaction, the bill amount is more than the e-Gift card value, the balance amount will have to paid by the customer.<br\\/>This e-Gift card can be redeemed at select Bhima Jewellers stores in India. For List of stores visit- https:\\/\\/w