ts for Good\\u2019.<br\\/>Refunds are not applicable on this voucher.<br\\/>Points for Good reserves the rights to edit\\/change the terms and conditions for the voucher\\/ E-Gift Card at any time by indicating the new terms and conditions on its website. <br\\/>For any queries \\/ issues related to eGift Card you can write in to info@pointsforgood.org\\/.<br\\/>The individual who has bought \\u2018Points for Good\\u2019 E-Voucher is deemed to be the donor.<br\\/>Points for Good\\u2019 is not responsible if the donation voucher is lost, stolen or used without permission."}', '["7","8","10","50","132","192","288","607","608","689","690"]', NULL, 'true', '[]', 'false', '6 months from the date of purchase', NULL, '[]', '[]', NULL, 'Strategic Caravan-Processing', '', 'a:9:{s:7:"barcode";a:1:{s:8:"encoding";N;}s:15:"redemptionTerms";a:0:{}s:4:"type";s:3:"clp";s:4:"code";s:35:"Strategic Caravan Online eGift Card";s:13:"erupi_purpose";N;s:16:"erupi_payer_type";N;s:16:"erupi_payee_type";N;s:24:"erupi_recurrence_pattern";N;s:14:"erupi_validity";N;}', 'a:7:{s:7:"enabled";b:1;s:15:"payment_methods";a:1:{i:0;s:3:"svc";}s:13:"account_types";a:2:{i:0;s:12:"BANK_ACCOUNT";i:1;s:3:"UPI";}s:17:"transaction_types";a:3:{i:0;s:4:"IMPS";i:1;s:4:"NEFT";i:2;s:3:"UPI";}s:21:"maximum_beneficiaries";s:0:"";s:28:"validate_terms_and_condition";s:0:"";s:10:"validation";a:3:{s:6:"amount";s:1:"1";s:16:"edit_beneficiary";b:1;s:18:"convenience_charge";s:0:"";}}', '[{"code":false}]', 'strategic-caravan-e-gift-card-points-for-good', '250', '5000', NULL, '2023-12-11 13:37:38', '2021-08-30T12:31:34+00:00', '2023-11-28T19:16:20+00:00', 330),
	(194, 4005, 'EGCGBVIJSAL001', 'Vijay Sales E-Gift Card', 'Offering guests, the best in quality and service has been the primary principle at VIJAY SALES since its inception by Mr. Nanu Gupta, a visionary with astute business acumen and foresight.\r\nA marvellous journey that began with a small Electronics Showroom at Mahim in 1967, VIJAY SALES has since evolved and has become one of India’s biggest retail chains.\r\nVIJAY SALES caters to guests of all budgets and preferences. Today, you can shop for the best in Electronics from 110 aesthetically designed and conveniently located showrooms in cities like Mumbai, New Mumbai, Thane, Pune, Surat, Vadodara, Ahmedabad, Delhi, Gurgaon, Faridabad, Indirapuram, Noida, Hyderabad, Vijayawada, Warangal, Vishakhapatnam, Tirupati, Kakinada & Rajahmundry.\r\nAlong with a dedicated team of prolific managers, Mr. Nanu Gupta and his sons Nilesh Gupta and Ashish Gupta stand tall on the promise of serving their guests with the absolute best in both product and after-sales service.\r\nBade Sir’s guest-focussed initiatives and intuitive understanding of emerging markets have helped VIJAY SALES to become a household name and the first preference for many when it comes to quality electronics and consumer durables.', '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"100","max":"10000","denominations":["500","1000","2000","5000","10000"],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 0, NULL, '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"100","max":"10000","denominations":["500","1000","2000","5000","10000"],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 'DIGITAL', '0', '{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"}', '356', '{"thumbnail":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBVIJSAL001\\/d\\/thumbnail\\/4005_microsite.jpg","mobile":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBVIJSAL001\\/d\\/mobile\\/4005_microsite.jpg","base":"https:\\/\\