	(195, 4101, 'EGVGBSL007', 'Sony Liv E-Gift Voucher 1 Month subscription', 'Sony Liv is among the most popular streaming services available to online users. It provides unlimited access to all the latest movies, television shows and series. Sony\'s first premium video-on-demand service lets users watch and access videos across devices on multiple screens. Sony Liv has a wide variety of entertaining content from all Sony Entertainment Television platforms and also allows users to access a wide range of movies, sporting events, TV shows and much more exclusive premium content. Sony Liv also provides some brilliant original series for you to binge on. At the convenience of your mobile you can watch it from any part of the country, or enjoy it live.\r\n \r\nSony Liv\'s premium subscription comes with great benefits, with a fixed subscription fee of Rs.299 per month, Rs.699 for six months and Rs.999 per year. It offers users a broad array of SET channels for movies and serials such as Sony Pix, Sony MAX, SAB and AXN along with some sports channels such as TEN1, Sony TEN2, Sony ESPN and Sony SIX.                                                                                                                        \r\n\r\nGift cards make online transactions easier and are great for saving time and money. Whether you are shopping for someone else or buying something for yourself, gift cards allows you to grab great deals. When it comes to choosing of gift, What’s better than gifting something entertaining to your friends and family? Sony Liv E-Gift Cards make a great gift for your loved ones who like entertainment. So, If you often find your friend stuck to the couch in front of TV or someone who leaves the party early to catch that show on TV, give them a Sony Liv gift card today and let them enjoy the benefit of Video-on-demand service and benefit of never missing out on any show.', '{"price":"SLAB","type":"SLAB","min":"299","max":"299","denominations":["299"],"currency":