	(203, 4402, 'EGCGBTBZ001', 'TBZ-The Original Jewellery Retail  E-Gift Card', 'TBZ – The Original is a brand that is coveted for its promise of innovative designs, exemplary quality of workmanship and trust that spans over 156 years. Our brand has been synonymous with jewellery for weddings, celebrations, and festive occasions as well for everyday wear for young India that has electric taste and seeks jewellery that is aspirational. Our enduring collection of aesthetically designed pieces epitomises the spirit of femininity, elegance, and grace.\r\nInspired by our legacy and by staying true to the values of trust, quality, and craftsmanship that we have inherited, we have carved a niche for ourselves. We have been at the forefront of designing traditional as well as contemporary collections and are trendsetters setting benchmarks of excellence in all that we do.\r\nEvery jewellery piece comes with a buyback guarantee. We were the first in India to promote the concept of lightweight precious jewellery, offer lifetime buyback on gold and diamond jewellery, provide certified solitaire diamonds, and introduce 100% BIS hallmarked 22 karat gold jewellery. Our pioneering focus is also reflected in the overall professional working environment in our Company and is visible in the high standards of corporate, transparency in reporting and ethical business practices we adopt.', '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"500","max":"50000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 0, NULL, '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"500","max":"50000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 'DIGITAL', '0', '{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"}', '356', '{"thumbnail":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBTBZ001\\/d\\/thumbnail\\/4402_microsite.jpg","mobile":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBTBZ001\\/d\\/mobile\\/4402_microsite.jpg","base":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBTBZ001\\/d\\/image\\/4402_microsite.jpg","small":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBTBZ001\\/d\\/small_image\\/4402_microsite.jpg"}', '{"link":"https:\\/\\/woohoo.app.link\\/e\\/Xw9eunzbelb","content":"This E- gift card is valid for 12 month (365 days) from the date of activation.<br\\/>The maximum amount of E-Gift Card shall not exceed Rs. 50,000\\/- at any point of time.<br\\/>This E-gift cards can only be used to purchase product\\/s at any TBZ-The Original outlet.<br\\/>This E- gift card can be used only for once within the validity period of 12 months for the entire amount loaded on the E-Gift Card at a time. E-Gift card cannot be redeemed partially. In case if the amount redeemed is lower than the amount loaded on card than the balance amount will lapse and cannot be used.<br\\/>On expiry of the E-gift card, any unused balance will not be refunded or credited.<br\\/>This E-gift card will not be replaced or reimbursed the value of your card in case of lost, stolen, damaged or expired <br\\/>Balance and validity of the gift card can be checked at the cash counter of any TBZ-The Original outlet or visit www.woohoo.in <br\\/>These Terms & conditions are subject to change anytime without any prior notice"}', '["7","10","50","55","132","192","288","607","608","610","620","689","690","815"]', NULL, 'false', '[]', 'false', '365 days from the date of activation', NULL, '[]', '[]', NULL, 'TBZ-The Original', '', 'a:9:{s:7:"barcode";a:1:{s:8:"encoding";N;}s:15:"redemptionTerms";a:0:{}s:4:"type";s:3:"clp";s:4:"code";s:15:"TBZ eGift Cards";s:13:"erupi_purpose";N;s:16:"erupi_payer_type";N;s:16:"erupi_payee_type";N;s:24:"erupi_recurrence_pattern";N;s:14:"erupi_validity";N;}', 'a:7:{s:7:"enabled";b:1;s:15:"payment_methods";a:1:{i:0;s:3:"svc";}s:13:"account_types";a:2:{i:0;s:12:"BANK_ACCOUNT";i:1;s:3:"UPI";}s:17:"transaction_types";a:3:{i:0;