	(204, 4429, 'EGCGBHME001', '@ Home E-Gift Card', '@home is the retail division of Nilkamal Limited, the world\'s largest manufacturer of moulded furniture & India\'s leading manufacturer of Material Handling Systems.', '{"price":"SLAB","type":"SLAB","min":"500","max":"5000","denominations":["500","1000","5000"],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 0, NULL, '{"price":"SLAB","type":"SLAB","min":"500","max":"5000","denominations":["500","1000","5000"],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 'DIGITAL', '0', '{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"}', '356', '{"thumbnail":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBHME001\\/d\\/thumbnail\\/4429_microsite.jpg","mobile":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBHME001\\/d\\/mobile\\/4429_microsite.jpg","base":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBHME001\\/d\\/image\\/4429_microsite.jpg","small":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBHME001\\/d\\/small_image\\/4429_microsite.jpg"}', '{"link":"https:\\/\\/woohoo.app.link\\/e\\/10b8ZEDdqlb","content":"By purchasing the e-Gift Card(s), you are agreeing to and accepting these Terms & Conditions. <br\\/>This E-Gift card is valid for one year from the date of Purchase.<br\\/>The E-Gift card is issued by @home, Nilkamal Limited (Company)<br\\/>The E \\u2013 Gift cards can be redeemed at www.at-home.co.in and at @home stores only. <br\\/>No refund, replacement or cash back would be considered against this E-Gift card.<br\\/>Gift Card can\\u2019t be replaced or duplicated if stolen or lost.<br\\/>Once E-Gift Card is purchased, the company will not accept any request for cancellation <br\\/>E\\u2013 Gift card can be redeemed only once. If the value of the merchandise exceeds the value of the E \\u2013 Gift card, the differential amount of such purchase should be paid by using modes of payment available on website or at store. Balance if any, of the E-Gift after purchase shall not be carried forward. <br\\/>For any query, please contact any @home store or call on customer care at 1-800-121-1414.<br\\/>In case of Returns\\/cancellations of the redemption done via E-Gift, the refund of the same will be done to the effect of the value of contribution of the E-Gift to the sale. The balance will be done via the contribution of the other respective payment mode to the sale. In the case of multiple products being purchased and a combination of the E-Gift and any other mode of payment being used to complete the transaction, the individual products being sold, will get the assignment of the value of the E-Gift and any other mode of payment being used based on the tender percentage contribution in total order value. The refund will happen in the same percentage split as per the original tender used.<br\\/>The E-Gift can be utilized with combination of other promotional offers at store or website.<br\\/>Redemption of E- Gift by its bearer shall be valid discharge of the company\'s liabilities in respect of E- Gift<br\\/>Any dispute need to be referred to the Company and the decision of the company shall be final.<br\\/>The E-Gift Card is subject to applicable laws. <br\\/>Any dispute relating to the E-Gift Card shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of courts at Mumbai.<br\\/>Nilkamal Ltd shall be entitled to amend these terms and conditions from time to time. Any change in these terms and conditions can be viewed on our Website and\\/or at any of the @home stores.<br\\/>E-Gift Cards are normally delivered instantly. But sometimes due to system issues, the delivery can be delayed up-to 24 - 48 hours."}', '["7","8","10","50","132","192","288","607","608","610","689","690","692","797","815"]', NULL, 'false', '[]', 'false', '365 Days from the date of issue', NULL, '[]', '[]', NULL, 'At Home', '', 'a:9:{s:7:"barcode";a:1:{s:8:"encoding";N;}s:15:"redemptionTerm