	(214, 5965, 'EGCGBLBF004', 'Asia Seven Express E-Gift Card', 'The Lion Head is a representation of the Royal State of Punjab. In Ancient India, Maharaja Ranjit Singh was bestowed with the title of Sher-e-Punjab which meant – The Lion of Punjab for his bravery and courage. It was during his era that the State and its people gained great prominence and became known for their bravery in the battle field. Punjab Grill is an endeavour by Lite Bite Foods to take our guests on a culinary journey into the grandeur of the Royal State of undivided Punjab.\r\nStreet Foods by Punjab Grill is the destination to experience our indigenous cuisine, culture & community. We bring the rich culinary experience to your taste buds.  Savour mouth melting lazeez kebabs, gorge on aromatic matkadum biryani or brighten up the day with kulhadwali chai. The meal can be rounded with rich apple phirni. Inspired by the by lanes of India, the food prepared and served is presented in its hygienic avatar. It is also our effort to increase the usage of ecofriendly earthen ware.\r\nAsia Seven infuses an abundance of ingredients sourced from each region to enhance the traditional fare. Experience the vivid colours and aromatic flavours of Asia at our award - winning restaurant. While the famed and extensive dumplings range are at the heart of the menu, our culinary repertoire is much broader with a variety of noodles, wok-fried seafood & juicy spiced meat, all showcasing the finest of fresh seasonal produce.\r\nYOÜMEE is a reflection of an overall cultural interest in food and cooking. The place is not just about fiery battles and the story, it is about the language of vegetables, meat, spices, and herbs.\r\nLocated in Gurgaon, the ambience at Zambar is experiential and\r\npromises to show the different facets of Southern India through vibrant\r\ndelicacies and dynamic décor. The menu of Zambar is exhaustive going\r\nfar beyond the staple offering of sambar, dosa, vada and idli. There is a\r\nrange of vegetarian fusion dishes like Charcoal Tandoor SrilankanKotthu\r\nRoti, Andhra Tomato Pappu Dhal, the ChettinadKozhambhu,\r\nGobhiKempuBezule, KajuKothumir Wade or Zambar  Dosa.', '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"500","max":"50000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 0, NULL, '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"500","max":"50000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 'DIGITAL', '0', '{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"}', '356', '{"thumbnail":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBLBF004\\/d\\/thumbnail\\/5965_microsite.jpg","mobile":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBLBF004\\/d\\/mobile\\/5965_microsite.jpg","base":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBLBF004\\/d\\/image\\/5965_microsite.jpg","small":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBLBF004\\/d\\/small_image\\/5965_microsite.jpg"}', '{"link":"https:\\/\\/woohoo.app.link\\/e\\/oAqWBe1jBrb","content":"Redeemable across all LBF outlets<br\\/>Not valid on 31st December.<br\\/>Valid only on Dine in\\/take away.<br\\/>Validity 6 months from the date of issue.<br\\/>Only one voucher can be redeemed in one bill<br\\/>Voucher Type : Digital.<br\\/>This voucher cannot be club with any other offers running at outlets.<br\\/>The voucher can be redeemed only once.<br\\/>The intended recipient can use the voucher only and the voucher cannot be transferred to, resold to \\/ exchanged with a third party or cannot be encashed.<br\\/>Prior reservation is recommended.<br\\/>A voucher will not be valid for use and may be rejected or cancelled at any time by Lite Bite Foods, if it reasonably believes there has been a breach of any condition. The voucher holder agrees it has no claim against Lite Bite Foods in the event of such rejection or cancellation.<br\\/>In case you h