GC will be given. <br\\/>AB\'s GV \\/ GC CANNOT be revalidated once expired. <br\\/>This E-Voucher cannot be exchanged for cash.<br\\/>AB\'s GV \\/ GC cannot be redeemed on specific block out dates. AB\'s may add or delete any date on its sole discretion. <br\\/>Any dispute related to the GV \\/ GC should be referred to the issuing company and the decision of the issuing company shall be final. <br\\/>AB\'s makes full efforts to accept Insta Gift Vouchers (GV) \\/ Gift Card (GC), but on account of any technical \\/ administrative reasons an outlet may refuse to accept the same. <br\\/>If an Insta Gift Voucher (GV) \\/Gift Card (GC) gets blocked on account of technical issue, it would get enabled in 72 hours. <br\\/>Please contact outlet manager for any acceptance issue and if issue is still not resolved, you can write to celebrations@absolute-barbecue.com <br\\/>All disputes shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of competent courts of Hyderabad, India.<br\\/>Absolute Barbecues reserves the right to change the \'Terms & Conditions\' at any time without prior information"}', '["7","50","132","288","607","608","610","632","689","690","797","808","815"]', NULL, 'false', '[]', 'false', '365 days from the date of activation.', NULL, '[]', '[]', NULL, 'Absolute Barbecues', '', 'a:9:{s:7:"barcode";a:1:{s:8:"encoding";N;}s:15:"redemptionTerms";a:0:{}s:4:"type";s:3:"clp";s:4:"code";s:29:"Absolute Barbecues eGift Card";s:13:"erupi_purpose";N;s:16:"erupi_payer_type";N;s:16:"erupi_payee_type";N;s:24:"erupi_recurrence_pattern";N;s:14:"erupi_validity";N;}', 'a:7:{s:7:"enabled";b:1;s:15:"payment_methods";a:1:{i:0;s:3:"svc";}s:13:"account_types";a:2:{i:0;s:12:"BANK_ACCOUNT";i:1;s:3:"UPI";}s:17:"transaction_types";a:3:{i:0;s:4:"IMPS";i:1;s:4:"NEFT";i:2;s:3:"UPI";}s:21:"maximum_beneficiaries";s:0:"";s:28:"validate_terms_and_condition";s:0:"";s:10:"validation";a:3:{s:6:"amount";s:1:"1";s:16:"edit_beneficiary";b:1;s:18:"convenience_charge";s:0:"";}}', '[{"code":false}]', 'absol