 Card with RBI or such statutory authorities. Rebel Marketplace India Private Limited \\/ Pine Labs may contact the purchaser\\/redeemer of the Faasos Gift Card for any such information.<br\\/>In the event the beneficiary\\/Know Your Customer (KYC;) details as per RBI Guidelines are found to be incorrect\\/insufficient, Rebel Marketplace India Private Limited \\/Pine Labs retain the right to cancel the Gift Card so issued<br\\/>Rebel Marketplace India Private Limited shall honour and consider requests for blocking of Gift Cards only from users who have registered in accordance with the terms<br\\/>The Faasos Gift Card can be purchased by debit cards and credit cards issued by Indian Banks. No Gift Card may be purchased by cash or by prepaid wallets.<br\\/>The Faasos Gift Card cannot be used to purchase another Faasos Gift Card<br\\/>No cash withdrawal is permissible against the Faasos Gift Card<br\\/>Rebel Marketplace India Private Limited \\/ Pine Labs Private Limited reserves the right to cancel the Faasos Gift Card if the same have been found to be purchased with fraudulent means. In such cases, the funds shall be credited back to the same source from where these were received.<br\\/>In case the order is cancelled within the timeframe as mentioned in the Cancellation Policy, wherein the Customer has redeemed the Faasos Gift Card, in such scenario the Customers\\u2019 Faasos Gift Card shall be credited with the amount equivalent to the redemption amount.<br\\/>The cardholder may request for the revalidation of the expired Gift Card. Upon receipt of such request, the Faasos Gift Card may be revalidated after due verification and maybe subject to additional terms and conditions<br\\/>The Faasos Gift Card is redeemable only on the EatSure iOS\\/android app<br\\/>To redeem, user must enter the 16-digit Gift Card number and the mpin on the payment\\/check out page<br\\/>If the value of the service exceeds the value of the Gift Card, the difference must be paid by the u