	(227, 6937, 'EGCGBZOMA002', 'Zomato E-Gift Card - B2B', 'Launched in 2010, Zomato\'s technology platform connects customers, restaurant partners and delivery partners, serving their multiple needs. Customers use our platform to search and discover restaurants , read and write customer generated reviews and view and upload photos, order food delivery, book a table and make payments while dining out at restaurants', '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"100","max":"10000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 0, NULL, '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"100","max":"10000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 'DIGITAL', '0', '{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"}', '356', '{"thumbnail":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBZOMA002\\/d\\/thumbnail\\/6937_microsite.jpg","mobile":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBZOMA002\\/d\\/mobile\\/6937_microsite.jpg","base":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBZOMA002\\/d\\/image\\/6937_microsite.jpg","small":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBZOMA002\\/d\\/small_image\\/6937_microsite.jpg"}', '{"link":"https:\\/\\/www.qwikcilver.com\\/terms-and-conditions","content":"These terms and conditions apply to Zomato Gift PPIs(\\"Gift PPIs\\") are issued by Pinelabs Private Limited (\\"Pinelabs\\") for your (\\u201cUser\\u201d) use. Pinelabs is a private limited company incorporated under the laws of India authorized to issue such Gift PPIsin compliance with applicable Reserve Bank of India (\\u201cRBI\\u201d) regulations. The Gift PPIs are issued under the Brand Name of Qwikcilver. Zomato Limited (\\u201cZomato\\u201d) is the co-branding partner for the Gift PPIs.<br\\/>By purchasing, using or redeeming a Gift PPIs, the User is agreeing to accept and be bound by these terms and conditions, as updated or modified from time to time.<br\\/>This Gift PPIs bear a 16-digit electronic PPI number along with a 6-digit pin.<br\\/>Gift PPIs can be redeemed toward the purchase of eligible products ONLY on www.Zomato.com and mobile application under the brand name of Zomato (\\u201cZomato Platform\\u201d).<br\\/>Once the Gift PPI is purchased, the User cannot cancel it, return it, seek a refund for it or redeem the Gift PPI for cash or credit, except where required by law.<br\\/>As a pre-requisite to redeeming the Gift PPI, the User will be required to add the value stored on this Gift PPI into their valid account on the Zomato Platform (\\u201cZomato Account\\u201d). The loading of the Gift PPI onto the Zomato Platform shall constitute a registration of the User with Pinelabs.<br\\/>The balance in the Zomato Account shall be deducted when the User makes purchases on the Zomato Platform.<br\\/>The Gift PPI can be combined with promotional codes and with other digital payment options.<br\\/>Gift PPI cannot be used to purchase other gift PPIs.<br\\/>Gift PPI cannot be reloaded or redeemed for cash.<br\\/>Unused Gift PPI balances associated with a Zomato Account cannot be transferred to another Zomato Account.<br\\/>Gift PPIss may only be purchased in denominations ranging from INR 100 to INR 10,000, or such other limits as Pinelabs\\/Zomato may determine.<br\\/>In case of multiple Gift PPIs being loaded to a User\\u2019s Zomato Account, the Gift PPIs having the earliest expiration date will be applied to the User\\u2019s purchases on the Zomato Platform.<br\\/>There is no fee or other charges associated with Gift PPI purchase.<br\\/>No interest will be payable by Pinelabs on any Gift PPI or Gift PPIs balance.<br\\/>This Gift PPI is valid for a period of 3 (Three) years from the date of Issuance of the Gift PPI.<br\\/>User may request the revalidation of the expired Gift PPI. Upon receipt of such a request, the Gift PPI may be revalidated after due verifica