	(229, 6994, 'EGCGBTWCR001', 'Third Wave Coffee E-Gift Card', 'Third Wave Coffee was born with the intention of introducing India to a perfectly brewed cup of coffee. Our vision is to curate the best experiences over the freshest coffee, both at our cafes and at home. Our selections are sourced from the top producers in the country and are handpicked, carefully roasted and used to make a variety of caffeine creations. We truly believe that coffee has the power to start conversations and build communities.', '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"100","max":"10000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 0, NULL, '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"100","max":"10000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 'DIGITAL', '0', '{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"}', '356', '{"thumbnail":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBTWCR001\\/d\\/thumbnail\\/6994_microsite.jpg","mobile":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBTWCR001\\/d\\/mobile\\/6994_microsite.jpg","base":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBTWCR001\\/d\\/image\\/6994_microsite.jpg","small":"https:\\/\\/giftbig.s3.amazonaws.com\\/microsite\\/product\\/EGCGBTWCR001\\/d\\/small_image\\/6994_microsite.jpg"}', '{"link":"https:\\/\\/woohoo.app.link\\/e\\/hRkxwK80Dub","content":"By using your Third Wave Coffee eGift Card, you agree to these terms and conditions (\\u201cTerms and<br\\/>Conditions\\u201d). Please ensure that you have read carefully and understood these Terms and<br\\/>Conditions before using your Third Wave Coffee eGift Card. Please note that these Terms and<br\\/>Conditions only govern the use of the Third Wave Coffee eGift Card, and the terms and conditions<br\\/>for usage of the Third Wave Coffee India mobile app,Third Wave Coffee Rewards Membership ,<br\\/>shall continue to apply.<b