	(232, 7381, 'EGCGBMFLABS001', 'Moonfrog E-Gift Card', 'Moonfrog Games E-Gift Cards make a great gift for your loved ones who like playing social, casual card and board games like CARROM, TEEN PATTI, LUDO etc. So, give your friends a Moonfrog Games gift card today and let them enjoy the benefit of Free to play gaming experience connecting our millions of players globally, NO REAL MONEY GAMING.Surprise your friends with something they did not expect. Gift your friends an opportunity to join the network of our millions of users across the globe and enjoy the excitement of playing our popular social and casual games.Play Teen Patti Gold LIVE with REAL players from around the world.Find us on App Store & Google Play https://tpgold.page.link/TeenPattiGoldFBCARROM GOLD is an exciting game which has been played offline for ages. It is known by many names around the world like Karambol, Karembol, Caram, etc. This quick to play disc pool game has the smoothest gameplay and jaw-dropping physics. Whether you call it Karambol, Karembol, Caram, or Carom, it’s just unlimited fun to play! So, pick up your phone, aim for the hole, pot the pucks, and become the King of carrom board game!Ludo Club is the best online ludo app to play ludo with friends! Your search for a multiplayer ludo app to play ludo with friends ends here! Time will fly like never before as you play this SUPER ludo online game, chatting and enjoying with friends and learning all the skills needed to become a ludo star! Dive into the world of this amazing online ludo game - participate in weekly quests, beat ludo masters from around the world, unlock colourful dice and show them off to your friends!', '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"10","max":"50000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 0, NULL, '{"price":"RANGE","type":"RANGE","min":"10","max":"50000","denominations":[],"currency":{"code":"INR","symbol":"\\u20b9","numericCode":"356"},"cpg":[]}', 'D