q (Tata Unistore Ltd) shall honour and consider requests for blocking of Gift Cards only from users who have registered in accordance with the terms above.<br\\/>Please refer the Customer Grievance policy for dispute resolution, unauthorized transactions and liability related aspects at https:\\/\\/www.qwikcilver.com\\/grievance-policy\\/.<br\\/>The cardholder may request for the revalidation of the expired Gift Card. Upon receipt of such request the Gift Card may be revalidated after due verification and maybe subject to additional terms and conditions.<br\\/>E-Gift Cards are normally delivered instantly. But sometimes due to system issues, the delivery can be delayed up-to 24 hours.<br\\/>No returns and no refunds on gift cards, E- gift cards and gift vouchers shipped by woohoo.in.Please check the refund policy at http:\\/\\/www.woohoo.in\\/faq for further details"}', '["7","10","50","70","288","607","608","610","689","690","692"]', NULL, 'false', '[]', 'false', '365 Days from the date of activation', NULL, '[]', '[]', NULL, 'TUL SCLP Luxury eGift card', '', 'a:4:{s:7:"barcode";a:1:{s:8:"encoding";N;}s:15:"redemptionTerms";a:0:{}s:4:"type";s:4:"sclp";s:4:"code";s:26:"TUL SCLP Luxury eGift card";}', 'a:7:{s:7:"enabled";b:1;s:15:"payment_methods";a:1:{i:0;s:3:"svc";}s:13:"account_types";a:2:{i:0;s:12:"BANK_ACCOUNT";i:1;s:3:"UPI";}s:17:"transaction_types";a:3:{i:0;s:4:"IMPS";i:1;s:4:"NEFT";i:2;s:3:"UPI";}s:21:"maximum_beneficiaries";s:0:"";s:28:"validate_terms_and_condition";s:0:"";s:10:"validation";a:3:{s:6:"amount";s:1:"1";s:16:"edit_beneficiary";b:1;s:18:"convenience_charge";s:0:"";}}', '[{"code":false}]', 'tul-sclp-luxury-egift-card', '1', '10000', NULL, '2023-12-11 13:37:53', '2023-03-03T13:58:22+00:00', '2023-12-08T07:01:17+00:00', 330),
